+"The kithara, ancient Greece's concert lyre with a wooden sound box: plucked with a plectrum, bright and resonant.": "A cítara, lira de concerto da Grécia antiga com caixa de ressonância de madeira: dedilhada com plectro, clara e ressonante.",
