+"Standing instructions added to every draft: language, phonetics, spelling, names, what to keep…": "每份草稿都附加的固定说明：语言、发音、拼写、名字、要保留的…",
+"Paste a piece of text": "粘贴一段文字",
+"Writer: no chat server set. Engine → Chat server (vLLM, LM Studio, Ollama), or choose OpenRouter below.": "写作室：未设置聊天服务器。引擎 → 聊天服务器（vLLM、LM Studio、Ollama），或在下面选择 OpenRouter。",
+"The key the imported notes are written in: the file's own key signature, or C when it has none; or the key you pick here.": "导入音符所用的调性：文件自身的调号，没有就用 C；或者你在这里选的调性。",
+"UniverSR on Forge draws the top of the spectrum anew. Each run is a branch of the tree; its variants differ by the noise.": "Forge 上的 UniverSR 重新绘制频谱的高端。每次运行都是树上的一个分支；它的变体只在噪声上不同。",
+"The workspace in hand: the takes list shows only its takes, and every new take lands in it. All Workspaces shows every take.": "手头的工作区：录音列表只显示它的录音，每个新录音都会落入其中。“全部工作区”显示所有录音。",
+"The base model's weights while training: bf16, the full ones (a 24 GB card), or int8 for smaller cards, a little less exact.": "训练时基础模型的权重：bf16 为完整权重（24 GB 显卡），小显卡用 int8，精度略低。",
+"The music half's learning rate as a share of the one above: 0.5 learns half as fast. It learns a small set by heart quickly.": "音乐一半的学习率，按上面那个的比例：0.5 学得慢一半。小数据集它很快就会背下来。",
+"The shape of the lyrics the writer drafts: which sections (verse, chorus, bridge, pre-chorus, intro, outro) and in what order.": "写作室起草的歌词形态：哪些段落（主歌、副歌、桥段、预副歌、前奏、尾奏）以及顺序。",
+"Fills model, context rows, keep loaded and VAE tiles for a card of that size; press Save to apply. Auto reads this GPU's memory.": "为该大小的显卡填好模型、上下文行数、保持加载和 VAE 分块；按保存生效。自动会读取这张 GPU 的显存。",
+"The Debunker v6 on Forge: mix the stems or take the take, clean, de-ess, 432 Hz, loudness. Each run is a new branch of the tree.": "Forge 上的 Debunker v6：混合分轨或使用录音本身，清理、去齿音、432 Hz、响度。每次运行都是树上的一个新分支。",
+"Day. Click: day → night → as the system. Day Scroll & Brick, night Scroll by Lamplight: pick another in the list to change either.": "白天。点击：白天 → 夜间 → 跟随系统。白天 Scroll & Brick，夜间 Scroll by Lamplight：在列表中另选一个即可更换。",
+"The set's folder: datasets/prepared/NAME/. Made again under the same name, the old set steps aside whole (kept as .NAME.date.old).": "数据集的文件夹：datasets/prepared/NAME/。以同名重新制作时，旧数据集整体让到一边（保存为 .NAME.date.old）。",
+"Standard: the quality choice, and the newer model. The current official decoder and the default, the cleanest sound.\nm-a-p/YuE2-Vae": "标准：质量之选，也是较新的模型。当前的官方解码器和默认值，声音最干净。\nm-a-p/YuE2-Vae",
+"Any model of openrouter.ai/models, written provider/model; the field offers the whole list as you type. The quick picks fill it in.": "openrouter.ai/models 中的任意模型，写作 提供商/模型；输入时字段会给出完整列表。快速选择会自动填好。",
+"Rewrite the style for YuE2: keep every audible detail, drop what it cannot hear, and make key, meter and tempo agree with the score.": "为 YuE2 重写风格：保留每个可听见的细节，去掉它听不到的内容，并让调性、拍号和速度与乐谱一致。",
+"How many recent tokens the repetition penalty looks back over. Default 100.\n✓ Leave it.\n⚠ It does nothing while the penalty is at 1.0.": "重复惩罚向前回看多少个最近的 token。默认 100。\n✓ 保持不变。\n⚠ 惩罚为 1.0 时它不起作用。",
+"A recording to take the melody from (WAV, FLAC, MP3, M4A, OGG). Only the tune is transcribed: not the words and not the singer's voice.": "用来提取旋律的录音（WAV、FLAC、MP3、M4A、OGG）。只扒曲调：不包括歌词和歌手的嗓音。",
+"Names the take in the library and every file it downloads as (date-time-title). It is not sent to the model and does not change the song.": "为库中的录音以及它下载的每个文件命名（日期-时间-标题）。不会发送给模型，也不会改变歌曲。",
+"WAV, FLAC, MP3… from anywhere: it becomes a take in the library (48 kHz 24-bit), marked imported, ready for stems, remaster and the rest.": "来自任何地方的 WAV、FLAC、MP3…：成为库中的一个录音（48 kHz 24 位），标记为导入，可用于分轨、重新母带等。",
+"A local language model turns a one-line idea into a title, style prompt and\n        lyrics. The browser talks to the chat server directly.": "本地语言模型把一行想法变成标题、风格提示词和\n歌词。浏览器直接与聊天服务器通信。",
+"Takes out a DC offset, the rumble under 20 Hz and anything above 22 kHz. A fade runs through the same step, so with a fade it is on anyway.": "去掉直流偏移、20 Hz 以下的隆隆声和 22 kHz 以上的一切。淡入淡出也经过同一步骤，所以有淡入淡出时它总是开启。",
+"A MIDI file back into a score: one melodic line per voice (a track named vocal/voice/melody becomes Vocal, the next one Ins), on a 1/16 grid": "把 MIDI 文件还原成乐谱：每个声部一条旋律线（名为 vocal/voice/melody 的轨道成为 Vocal，下一条成为 Ins），在 1/16 网格上",
+"Pick a document, or start one. A document is a title, STYLE, LYRICS, NOTES and PARAMS; it remembers its versions and the takes made from it.": "选择一个文档，或新建一个。文档包括标题、风格、歌词、备注和参数；它会记住自己的版本和由它生成的录音。",
+"Loudness in two passes (measured, then a linear gain), 48 kHz out. The result appears in the Stems tree above, with its loudness in and out.": "两遍处理的响度（先测量，再线性增益），输出 48 kHz。结果出现在上面的分轨树中，附带输入和输出响度。",
+"The run's name: its adapters land in loras/NAME/ as NAME-eNNN, ready in the Creator. A run of the same name goes on from its last checkpoint.": "运行的名称：它的适配器以 NAME-eNNN 存入 loras/NAME/，在创作室中即可使用。同名的运行会从它最后的检查点继续。",
+"The original stays sample for sample below the cutoff; only the new top is taken, joined by a smooth crossover. Off: the model's whole output.": "截止频率以下原声逐个采样保持不变；只取新的高频部分，用平滑的分频衔接。关闭：模型的全部输出。",
+"A song from the Writer into this form: its title, style and lyrics. It stays in hand, so the takes made from it are linked to it in the Writer.": "把写作室里的一首歌放进这个表单：它的标题、风格和歌词。它会留在手头，因此由它生成的录音会在写作室中与它关联。",
+"The key to move the score in the box to: every note moves by the same interval, and the key with them. Beside it: the nearest way, or up, or down.": "把框中乐谱移到的调性：每个音符移动相同的音程，调性也随之改变。旁边：最近的方向，或向上，或向下。",
+"Split on Forge: BS-Roformer for the voice, htdemucs_ft for drums, bass and the rest. Each file plays, goes into the spectrum and the lyrics check.": "在 Forge 上分离：人声用 BS-Roformer，鼓、贝斯和其余部分用 htdemucs_ft。每个文件都能播放，并可送入频谱和歌词检查。",
+"Blend: a mix of the two official decoders, ⅔ Standard and ⅓ Legacy (a community weight mix, not newly trained).\nMothersuperior/YuE2-Vae-merge-0.666": "混合：两个官方解码器的混合，⅔ 标准、⅓ 旧版（社区的权重混合，并非重新训练）。\nMothersuperior/YuE2-Vae-merge-0.666",
+"The longest answer the model may give, in tokens. Too few cut a song off in the middle; a thinking model spends part of them on its thinking first.": "模型可以给出的最长回答，以 token 计。太少会把歌截在中间；会思考的模型会先把一部分用在思考上。",
+"Shortcuts that set the knobs below; the middle is the tuned default.\n              Composition does nothing in Direct mode or with a supplied score.": "设置下面各滑块的快捷方式；中间是调好的默认值。\n在直接模式或提供乐谱时，作曲不起作用。",
+"The loudness target, in LUFS. −14 is about where Spotify and YouTube play; higher (−9) is louder and flatter, lower (−18) keeps more of the dynamics.": "响度目标，以 LUFS 计。−14 约为 Spotify 和 YouTube 的播放水平；更高（−9）更响更平，更低（−18）保留更多动态。",
+"Sets Guidance (CFG) from 0.85 to 1.15. Higher follows the style and lyrics more strongly; any setting except the middle runs the music stage at half speed.": "把引导（CFG）设在 0.85 到 1.15 之间。越高越紧跟风格和歌词；除中间值外的任何设置都会让音乐阶段以半速运行。",
+"Whisper with word times, then every lyric line on the time its words were heard; a line too little heard gets a time between its neighbours, marked guessed": "用带词时间的 Whisper，把每行歌词放到听到其词语的时间；听到太少的一行会取相邻两行之间的时间，并标记为推测",
+"The VAE decodes the song in tiles of this many frames (512 by default). Smaller tiles need less GPU memory at about the same speed, and give the same audio.": "VAE 按这么多帧的分块解码歌曲（默认 512）。更小的分块以大致相同的速度占用更少显存，得到的音频相同。",
+"Softens the hiss of s, sh and ts on the voice stems before they are mixed. Only for a set of stems: on the take, on a single file and in the chain it is off.": "在混音前柔化人声分轨上 s、sh、ts 的嘶声。仅用于一组分轨：对录音本身、单个文件和处理链中是关闭的。",
+"How wide the adapter's change is: 16 for one voice or instrument, 32 for a style, 64 for many voices, 128 at most. The line below gives its share and its size.": "适配器改变的幅度：一个人声或乐器用 16，一种风格用 32，多种人声用 64，最多 128。下面一行给出它的占比和大小。",
+"The font for labels, fields and paragraphs. The app's own fonts come first; under the line, fonts installed on this computer. Each browser keeps its own choice.": "标签、输入框和段落的字体。先列应用自带的字体；线下是这台电脑上安装的字体。每个浏览器保留自己的选择。",
+"Removes the chord symbols so the new style can build its own harmony (the run then uses Melody only). Untick to keep the original chords and render in Full mode.": "去掉和弦记号，让新风格构建自己的和声（运行将使用仅旋律）。取消勾选则保留原和弦并以完整模式渲染。",
+"How free the drafts are: lower keeps close to the brief and repeats itself more, higher invents more and wanders. Blank: the server's or the model's own default.": "草稿的自由度：越低越贴近简报、重复越多，越高越会创造和跑题。留空：服务器或模型自己的默认值。",
+"How many steps in all, one song a step. A small set is learnt by heart fast: the green epochs in the Telemetry are the ones to hear first, often before the last.": "总共多少步，每步一首歌。小数据集很快就会背熟：遥测中的绿色轮次最先值得听，常常在最后一轮之前。",
+"Theme, columns, folds, the form's draft, the player, the writing room: all back to defaults, here and in user/settings.json. The library and the engine settings stay.": "主题、栏宽、折叠、表单草稿、播放器、写作间：全部恢复默认，包括这里和 user/settings.json。库和引擎设置保持不变。",
+"Legacy: the older official decoder. The published benchmark scores were made with it; less clean than Standard, and some hear it as more musical.\nm-a-p/YuE2-Vae-legacy": "旧版：较早的官方解码器。公布的基准分数是用它得出的；不如标准干净，有人觉得它更有音乐性。\nm-a-p/YuE2-Vae-legacy",
+"Take the melody from a song you already made and render it somewhere else entirely: a ballad as a techno track, a German song in English. The run switches to Melody only.": "拿你已经做好的一首歌的旋律，在完全不同的地方重新渲染：把一首抒情歌做成 techno，把一首德语歌改成英语。运行会切换到仅旋律。",
+"Your OpenRouter key. The page sends it to openrouter.ai and nowhere else: not to the studio, not into its settings file. Without Remember it is gone when the page closes.": "你的 OpenRouter 密钥。页面只把它发送到 openrouter.ai：不发送到工作室，也不写入它的设置文件。不勾选“记住”，页面关闭后它就消失。",
+"How much the music half learns (the part that writes the song's tokens): 0 teaches the sound only, a timbre; raise it for diction and style, which live in the music half.": "音乐一半（写歌曲 token 的部分）学多少：0 只学声音、音色；要学咬字和风格就调高，它们都在音乐一半里。",
+"AI-Toolkit only. Every song is first split into voice and instrumental; the music half then also learns the voice from the lyrics alone and the music from the tags alone.": "仅限 AI-Toolkit。每首歌先分离成人声和伴奏；然后音乐一半还会只凭歌词学人声，只凭标签学音乐。",
+"The language model that drafts the brief (title, style and lyrics). Any instruction-following model works; a bigger one writes better lyrics, a smaller one answers faster.": "起草简报（标题、风格和歌词）的语言模型。任何能遵循指令的模型都可以；越大写的歌词越好，越小回答越快。",
+"The /v1 address of a chat server that is already running, for the idea writer. The page uses whatever model it has loaded; it never loads, switches or unloads a model there.": "已经在运行的聊天服务器的 /v1 地址，供想法写作使用。页面使用它已加载的模型；从不在那里加载、切换或卸载模型。",
+"Retake: this exact take into the form, with its score, both seeds and its music codes. Generate renders the same music again: try another VAE, sound seed or sound variations": "重录：把这个录音原样放进表单，带上它的乐谱、两个种子和音乐编码。“生成”会再次渲染同样的音乐：试试别的 VAE、声音种子或声音变体",
+"The copy of the model the engine loads (from the next song).\nBF16 · 7.2 GB · the full release\nQ8_0 · 3.8 GB · near lossless\nQ6_K · 2.9 GB, Q5_K_M · 2.6 GB · smaller, less VRAM": "引擎加载的模型副本（从下一首歌起）。\nBF16 · 7.2 GB · 完整发布版\nQ8_0 · 3.8 GB · 近乎无损\nQ6_K · 2.9 GB、Q5_K_M · 2.6 GB · 更小，更省显存",
+"About 1.6 times the length of the audio per variant on a 3090, in 20 s pieces joined by 1 s crossfades (measured: no step at a join beyond the difference between two renders).": "在 3090 上每个变体约为音频时长的 1.6 倍，按 20 秒分段，用 1 秒交叉淡化连接（实测：接缝处没有超出两次渲染差异的突变）。",
+"What may be wrong in the sound: a tone that will not leave, the VAE's 25-frame buzz in the highs, clicks, clipping, dropouts, stereo that fights itself. A time plays from there.": "声音中可能的问题：挥之不去的音、高频里 VAE 的 25 帧嗡声、咔嗒声、削波、掉音、自相抵消的立体声。点击时间会从那里播放。",
+"Then the take itself is split into stems: vocals (voice and instrumental, BS-Roformer) or four (also drums, bass and the rest, htdemucs_ft). From the take, not from the remaster.": "然后把录音本身分离成分轨：人声（人声和伴奏，BS-Roformer）或四轨（另有鼓、贝斯和其余部分，htdemucs_ft）。从录音分离，而不是从重新母带。",
+"By steps of the scale, in the score's key: a third up moves every note to the third above it in the key, its own sharps and flats kept. The other voice and the chord symbols stay.": "按音阶级数，在乐谱的调性内：高三度会把每个音移到调内上方的三度，保留它自己的升降号。另一个声部和和弦记号保持不变。",
+"Reuse: the prompt, lyrics and every setting (mode, sampling, guidance, VAE, sliders, LoRAs, output) for a new song: no score, no seeds, no music codes, so Generate writes new music": "以此为基础：把提示词、歌词和每项设置（模式、采样、引导、VAE、滑块、LoRA、输出）用于一首新歌：不带乐谱、种子和音乐编码，所以“生成”会写新的音乐",
+"Then the final file is measured for faults: a tone that will not leave, the frame buzz of the VAE, clicks, clipping, dropouts, stereo that fights itself. The Artifacts step shows them.": "然后测量最终文件的瑕疵：挥之不去的音、VAE 的帧嗡声、咔嗒声、削波、掉音、自相抵消的立体声。瑕疵步骤会显示它们。",
+"Keeps only this many of the most likely next music tokens. Default 100.\n✓ 50–100.\n⚠ Above about 150 rare tokens come through as garbled syllables; 200 is the \"highest\" Performance card.": "只保留这么多最可能的下一个音乐 token。默认 100。\n✓ 50–100。\n⚠ 超过约 150 时，罕见 token 会变成含混的音节；200 是演绎卡片中“最高”的那张。",
+", then watch it take shape: the score is\n        written, the music is composed, and the sound is rendered into your finished track. Any song you pick\n        from Takes opens here too.": "，然后看着它成形：乐谱被\n写出，音乐被创作，声音被渲染成你完成的音轨。你在录音中选的任何歌\n也会在这里打开。",
+"Bitrate when the song itself is made as MP3 (Format: MP3). 320 is near transparent; the server's own default is 128. To share a WAV song as MP3, use the MP3 download on its page instead.": "当歌曲本身以 MP3 制作时（格式：MP3）的码率。320 几乎听不出差别；服务器自己的默认值是 128。要把 WAV 歌曲以 MP3 分享，请改用它页面上的 MP3 下载。",
+"FLAC: the same song, lossless (every sample identical to the WAV) at about three quarters of the size. Made on the spot in about a second; the title and lyrics are written into the file.": "FLAC：同一首歌，无损（每个采样都与 WAV 相同），大小约为四分之三。当场约一秒生成；标题和歌词会写入文件。",
+"Start a new song: every field, both seeds, the score, loaded music codes, the mode, sampling, sliders, LoRAs and Instrumental back to their defaults. Sound and output (VAE, solver, steps, length, format) and the theme stay.": "开始一首新歌：每个字段、两个种子、乐谱、已载入的音乐编码、模式、采样、滑块、LoRA 和纯音乐都恢复默认。声音与输出（VAE、求解器、步数、时长、格式）和主题保持不变。",
+"One line about the song you want (a story, a mood, a genre). The writer model drafts the title, style prompt and lyrics from it, into the form below, where you can edit them before generating.": "用一行写出你想要的歌（一个故事、一种情绪、一个流派）。写作模型据此起草标题、风格提示词和歌词，放进下面的表单，你可以在生成前编辑。",
+"Lead melody: the most prominent line, voice or instrument, without chords (use Melody mode).\nVocal melody only: just the sung line.\nMelody and chords: melody plus chord symbols (use Full mode).": "主旋律：最突出的那条线，人声或乐器，不含和弦（用旋律模式）。\n仅人声旋律：只有唱的那条线。\n旋律与和弦：旋律加和弦记号（用完整模式）。",
+"How the stems are balanced in the mix, in dB a stem (the levels below win over it). Only for a set of stems: a single file, the take included, has nothing to balance, and the preset is off then.": "分轨在混音中的平衡，按每条分轨的 dB（下面的电平优先）。仅用于一组分轨：单个文件（包括录音本身）没有可平衡的，预设此时关闭。",
+"Keeps only this many of the most likely next notes. Default 50 (the release had 30).\n✓ 30–64.\n⚠ Above about 80, odd durations and broken bars come through. Below 10 it is nearly greedy; 1 is greedy.": "只保留这么多最可能的下一个音符。默认 50（发布版为 30）。\n✓ 30–64。\n⚠ 超过约 80 会出现古怪的时值和破碎的小节。低于 10 几乎是贪心的；1 就是贪心。",
+"About a minute for seven, on the CPU. The tree shows the ripple measured in and out: the 4–12 kHz envelope folded on 1920 samples, against 1900 and 1940 as controls (what any sound shows by chance).": "在 CPU 上处理 7 首歌约需一分钟。树上显示输入和输出时测得的波动：4–12 kHz 包络按 1920 个采样折叠，以 1900 和 1940 作对照（任何声音偶然都会显示的部分）。",
+"Renders the same music up to 9 times with different sound seeds (seed, seed + 1, …) in one pass. The music is written once, so this is a cheap way to pick the best-sounding render of a song you like.": "一次运行中用不同的声音种子（种子、种子 + 1、…）把同一段音乐最多渲染 9 次。音乐只写一次，所以这是为你喜欢的歌挑出最好听渲染的低成本办法。",
+"Ruach Studio: the studio's own trainer, on the full bf16 weights, Direct mode. AI-Toolkit (Ostris): the reference; it can also train with a score and on separated vocals. Both save the same LoRA format.": "Ruach Studio：工作室自己的训练器，用完整的 bf16 权重，直接模式。AI-Toolkit（Ostris）：参考实现；也能带乐谱训练，并在分离出的人声上训练。两者保存相同的 LoRA 格式。",
+"UniverSR redraws the top of the spectrum after Debuzz: subtle above 12 kHz, normal above 8, high above 6. One variant, the original kept below the cutoff; about 1.6 times the length of the song on a 3090.": "UniverSR 在去嗡声之后重绘频谱高端：轻微为 12 kHz 以上，普通为 8 以上，高为 6 以上。一个变体，截止频率以下保留原声；在 3090 上约为歌曲时长的 1.6 倍。",
+"Per minute: the mean match to the closest lyric line, 0.6 and up clear, below 0.4 glossolalia. \"Reached\" is the furthest line matched, not a count of lines sung. A click on a minute or a time plays from there.": "每分钟：与最接近歌词行的平均匹配度，0.6 及以上为清晰，低于 0.4 为无意义发声。“到达”是匹配到的最远一行，不是唱过的行数。点击某分钟或某个时间会从那里播放。",
+"Who drafts. The chat server set under Engine runs on your own machine (vLLM, LM Studio, Ollama): nothing leaves it. OpenRouter is a service on the internet: the brief and the song go to openrouter.ai, with your key.": "由谁起草。引擎中设置的聊天服务器运行在你自己的机器上（vLLM、LM Studio、Ollama）：什么都不会离开它。OpenRouter 是互联网上的服务：简报和歌曲会用你的密钥发送到 openrouter.ai。",
+"How a pasted text is made ready to read: replacement rules in order (literal or regular expression), then the shape — [Intro], [Verse] at blank lines, [Interlude] after long paragraphs. Applied from the Lyrics field.": "粘贴的文本如何整理成可朗读的样子：按顺序执行替换规则（字面或正则表达式），然后是形态 —— [Intro]、空行处加 [Verse]、长段落后加 [Interlude]。从歌词字段应用。",
+"Keeps only the most likely next notes, up to this share of the total chance. Default 0.95 (the release had 0.9).\n✓ 0.9–0.95.\n⚠ Below 0.7 the melody turns monotone. 1.0 switches it off and lets rare, broken tokens through.": "只保留最可能的下一个音符，直到累计概率达到这个比例。默认 0.95（发布版为 0.9）。\n✓ 0.9–0.95。\n⚠ 低于 0.7 旋律会变单调。1.0 会关闭它，让罕见的破碎 token 通过。",
+"Paste a whole text into Lyrics, pick a profile, Apply: its rules (cleanup, phonetics) and its shape ([Intro], [Verse] at blank lines, [Interlude] after long paragraphs) make it ready to read. Profiles are edited in the Write tab.": "把整段文本粘进歌词，选一个配置，点应用：它的规则（清理、发音）和形态（[Intro]、空行处加 [Verse]、长段落后加 [Interlude]）会把它整理成可朗读的样子。配置在写作标签页中编辑。",
+"A ceiling on the song's length in seconds (480 by default): the music stage stops at 25 tokens per second of this. The length itself comes from the lyrics and the score; this only cuts a runaway song short (it is then marked truncated).": "歌曲时长的上限，以秒计（默认 480）：音乐阶段在此时长每秒 25 个 token 处停止。时长本身由歌词和乐谱决定；这只用来截断失控的歌曲（之后会标记为截断）。",
+"AI-Toolkit only (the studio's own trainer is Direct). Direct: no score, for songs made in Direct mode. Full (score) and Melody: the music half also learns to write a score first, transcribed from every song, for songs made in those modes.": "仅限 AI-Toolkit（工作室自己的训练器为直接）。直接：没有乐谱，用于直接模式生成的歌曲。完整（乐谱）和旋律：音乐一半还学会先写乐谱（从每首歌扒谱得到），用于这些模式生成的歌曲。",
+"Makes notes used in the recent window less likely. Default 1.005, almost off.\n✓ Leave it at 1.0–1.01.\n⚠ A score repeats by nature: choruses, bar patterns. Above 1.05 the penalty breaks the repeats the song needs, and the choruses stop matching each other.": "降低最近窗口中用过的音符的概率。默认 1.005，几乎关闭。\n✓ 保持在 1.0–1.01。\n⚠ 乐谱天生会重复：副歌、小节型。超过 1.05 时惩罚会破坏歌曲需要的重复，副歌彼此就对不上了。",
+"SheetSage2 writes this take's own sound down as a score (the server reads the take itself; nothing is uploaded), into the form for a cover: with chords, or the melody only, as chosen under Cover a recording. Good for a reading made in Direct mode, which has no score.": "SheetSage2 把这个录音自身的声音记成乐谱（服务器直接读取录音；不上传任何东西），放进表单用于翻唱：带和弦，或仅旋律，按“翻唱录音”中的选择。适合用直接模式做的、没有乐谱的朗读。",
+"For readings and songs that go on past their text: Whisper finds where the text ends, and the same take is rendered again from its own music codes cut there (+1.5 s). The same performance, without the returns and babble after the last line; only the sound stage runs.": "适用于超出文本还在继续的朗读和歌曲：Whisper 找到文本结束的位置，用在那里截断的它自己的音乐编码重新渲染同一个录音（+1.5 秒）。同样的演绎，去掉了最后一行之后的重复和呓语；只运行声音阶段。",
+"Keeps only the most likely next music tokens, up to this share of the total chance. Default 0.95.\n✓ 0.9–0.95.\n⚠ 0.97 and up, together with a high temperature, is the glossolalia recipe: the \"high\" Performance card (1.1 · 0.97 · 140) garbled words on the same measured song.": "只保留最可能的下一个音乐 token，直到累计概率达到这个比例。默认 0.95。\n✓ 0.9–0.95。\n⚠ 0.97 及以上再加高温度，就是无意义发声的配方：演绎卡片中“高”那张（1.1 · 0.97 · 140）在同一首测量歌曲上把词唱乱了。",
+"YuE2's decoder writes sound in frames of 1920 samples, 25 a second, and its highs tremble with them: the metallic buzz. This takes out the part locked to that frame clock, above 2 kHz, the lows untouched. Before Upscale. On a track from elsewhere it finds nothing, and says so.": "YuE2 的解码器以每帧 1920 个采样、每秒 25 帧的方式写出声音，它的高频随帧抖动：就是那种金属嗡声。这会去掉与帧时钟同步的部分（2 kHz 以上），低频不受影响。在超分之前。对来自别处的音轨，它找不到任何东西，并会说明。",
+"Loudness. The song is normalised so its loudest part reaches full scale after ignoring this many samples per million (default 10: the top 0.001% are clipped, which also lifts quiet songs). 0 normalises to the true peak: no clipping, a little quieter. WAV 32-bit float is not normalised.": "响度。在忽略每百万个采样中这么多个之后，把歌曲最响的部分归一化到满刻度（默认 10：顶部 0.001% 被削掉，安静的歌也会被抬起）。0 则按真实峰值归一化：不削波，略轻一些。WAV 32 位浮点不做归一化。",
+"Fixes only the acoustic noise of the sound stage: the same music (melody, words, timing) played through a different grain. Blank means random each run; the dice puts one in, and pressing it again clears it. Change it, or use Re-render sound on a take, to get another rendering in seconds.": "只固定声音阶段的声学噪声：同样的音乐（旋律、歌词、节奏）透过不同的颗粒演奏。留空表示每次运行随机；骰子会放入一个，再按一次清除。改动它，或对录音使用“重新渲染声音”，几秒钟就能得到另一个渲染。",
+"The longest score, in tokens. Default 6144, 8192 at most.\n✓ 6144 holds a long song (4096 cut long scores short).\n⚠ The score and the music share ONE context of 24,576 tokens: every token given to the score is taken from the music. 8192 leaves the song too little room. A score cut off here cannot be used.": "最长的乐谱，以 token 计。默认 6144，最多 8192。\n✓ 6144 能容纳长歌（4096 会截断长乐谱）。\n⚠ 乐谱和音乐共用“一个”24,576 token 的上下文：给乐谱的每个 token 都从音乐中扣除。8192 留给歌曲的空间太少。在这里被截断的乐谱无法使用。",
+"Randomness of the score planner. Default 0.95 (Viktor's stable set; the release had 0.7).\n✓ 0.9–1.0 for melodies that do not sound stock; 0.6–0.8 for a song with a rigid structure.\n⚠ Above 1.0 bars break and sections go missing, and a broken score cannot be used. 0 is greedy: the same phrase over and over.": "乐谱规划器的随机性。默认 0.95（Viktor 的稳定设置；发布版为 0.7）。\n✓ 想要不落俗套的旋律用 0.9–1.0；结构严格的歌用 0.6–0.8。\n⚠ 超过 1.0 小节会断裂、段落会缺失，破碎的乐谱无法使用。0 是贪心：同一个乐句一遍又一遍。",
+"Regenerate from here: everything before the chosen moment stays exactly as it is (its music codes are kept), and the music is written anew from there with a new music seed. The moment is where the player stands when this take plays; otherwise you are asked. For a song or reading that breaks down after a point.": "从这里重新生成：所选时刻之前的一切原样保留（保留其音乐编码），从那里起用新的音乐种子重写音乐。时刻是这个录音播放时播放器所在的位置；否则会询问你。适用于在某个点之后崩坏的歌曲或朗读。",
+"Makes music tokens used in the recent window less likely. Default 1.3 with the window at 100 (Viktor's stable set; the release had 1.2 over 50).\n✓ 1.2–1.3. The music needs about this much to stay out of loops.\n⚠ Below 1.1 a line gets sung again and again. Above 1.3 the delivery turns restless and syllables drop out.": "降低最近窗口中用过的音乐 token 的概率。默认 1.3，窗口为 100（Viktor 的稳定设置；发布版为 50 上 1.2）。\n✓ 1.2–1.3。音乐大约需要这么多才不会陷入循环。\n⚠ 低于 1.1 一句会被唱个不停。高于 1.3 演绎会变得躁动，音节会掉落。",
+"The longest song, in music tokens: 25 per second, so the default 12000 is 8:00.\n✓ Set it close to the length the lyrics need.\n⚠ Much more room than the lyrics need, and after the last line the model goes back and sings earlier lines again (measured: 24 such returns after the lyrics ended). A song cut off here is marked truncated.": "最长的歌曲，以音乐 token 计：每秒 25 个，所以默认的 12000 就是 8:00。\n✓ 设得接近歌词所需的长度。\n⚠ 空间远超歌词所需时，最后一句之后模型会回头重唱前面的句子（实测：歌词结束后回头 24 次）。在这里被截断的歌曲会标记为截断。",
+"MP3 converter: makes a shareable MP3 from the lossless song on the server (a few seconds the first time, then kept). 320 kbps is near transparent (about 7 MB for 3 minutes); 256 is very good; 192 is good and smaller (about 4 MB); 128 is small, with audible loss on cymbals and reverb. The song title and lyrics are written into the file.": "MP3 转换器：把服务器上的无损歌曲做成可分享的 MP3（第一次几秒钟，之后保留）。320 kbps 几乎听不出差别（3 分钟约 7 MB）；256 很好；192 不错且更小（约 4 MB）；128 很小，镲片和混响上能听出损失。歌名和歌词会写入文件。",
+"Moves the score planner's temperature, top-p and top-k together. Left: familiar, safe melodies and chord changes; right: surprising ones. The middle is the default (0.95 · 0.95 · 50); \"lowest\" is the release (0.7 · 0.9 · 30). No effect in Direct mode or with a supplied score (nothing is planned).\n⚠ \"highest\" (1.15 · 0.97 · 80) can break bars.": "同时调节乐谱规划器的温度、top-p 和 top-k。左：熟悉稳妥的旋律与和弦进行；右：出人意料的。中间是默认值（0.95 · 0.95 · 50）；“最低”是发布版（0.7 · 0.9 · 30）。在直接模式或提供乐谱时无效（不做规划）。\n⚠ “最高”（1.15 · 0.97 · 80）可能弄坏小节。",
+"How many recent music tokens the repetition penalty looks back over. 25 tokens are one second: the default 100 is 4 seconds, which is also the ceiling (the release had 50, 2 seconds).\n✓ 100: it also catches loops longer than a short phrase.\n⚠ It prevents loops; it does not cure words breaking down in the middle of a song. For that, lower the temperature.": "重复惩罚向前回看多少个最近的音乐 token。25 个 token 为一秒：默认的 100 是 4 秒，这也是上限（发布版为 50，即 2 秒）。\n✓ 100：它也能抓住比短乐句更长的循环。\n⚠ 它防止循环；但治不了歌曲中段歌词崩坏。那要降低温度。",
+"A score in YuE2's own notation: two voices, Vocal and Ins (instrument), in bars of 1/32 notes, with chord symbols on the Vocal line and section comments (% verse). In Full or Melody mode the song follows it in time and pitch.\nCreate ABC Score writes one here to check or edit; a transcription or an older take can fill it too. For a cover, use Melody only with a score that has no chord symbols.": "YuE2 自己记法的乐谱：两个声部，Vocal 和 Ins（乐器），以 1/32 音符为单位的小节，Vocal 行上有和弦记号和段落注释（% verse）。在完整或旋律模式下，歌曲在时间和音高上遵循它。\n“创建 ABC 乐谱”会在这里写出一份供检查或编辑；扒谱或旧录音也可以填入。做翻唱时，用不带和弦记号的乐谱并选仅旋律。",
+"Moves the music stage's temperature, top-p and top-k together. Left: a steadier delivery that sticks to the prompt; right: looser and more adventurous, with more garbled words. The middle is the default (0.9 · 0.95 · 100); \"high\" is the release (1.0 · 0.95 · 100).\n✓ \"low\" (0.85 · 0.93 · 80) for songs where the words matter most.\n⚠ \"highest\" (1.1 · 0.97 · 140): measured glossolalia on a 7-minute song.": "同时调节音乐阶段的温度、top-p 和 top-k。左：更稳、紧贴提示词的演绎；右：更放松、更大胆，含糊的词也更多。中间是默认值（0.9 · 0.95 · 100）；“高”是发布版（1.0 · 0.95 · 100）。\n✓ 歌词最重要的歌用“低”（0.85 · 0.93 · 80）。\n⚠ “最高”（1.1 · 0.97 · 140）：在一首 7 分钟的歌上测到了无意义发声。",
+"Randomness of the music: how the words are sung. Default 0.9 (Viktor's stable set; the release had 1.0).\n✓ 0.85–0.95 for clear words. The cover configs on r/StableDiffusion keep it at 0.80–0.95.\n⚠ Above 1.0 the words blur into glossolalia, most of all after the fourth minute (measured on a 7-minute song: 1.1 lost 16 of 109 lines). Below 0.8 the delivery flattens and starts to loop. 0 is greedy and loops.": "音乐的随机性：歌词怎么唱。默认 0.9（Viktor 的稳定设置；发布版为 1.0）。\n✓ 歌词要清楚用 0.85–0.95。r/StableDiffusion 上的翻唱配置都保持在 0.80–0.95。\n⚠ 超过 1.0 歌词会糊成无意义发声，第四分钟之后尤甚（在 7 分钟的歌上实测：1.1 丢了 109 行中的 16 行）。低于 0.8 演绎会变平并开始循环。0 是贪心，会循环。",
+"Full plan: the model first writes a score (melody and chords) and the song follows it. Best for new songs; the score can be edited.\nMelody only: the score has the melody but no chords, so the accompaniment is free. Recommended for covers.\nDirect: no score; the music is written straight from style and lyrics. Some add-ons (the sliders, some LoRAs) were trained this way.\nA supplied score needs Full or Melody.": "完整规划：模型先写乐谱（旋律与和弦），歌曲随之而行。最适合新歌；乐谱可以编辑。\n仅旋律：乐谱有旋律但没有和弦，所以伴奏是自由的。推荐用于翻唱。\n直接：没有乐谱；直接从风格和歌词写音乐。一些附加组件（滑块、部分 LoRA）就是这样训练的。\n提供的乐谱需要完整或旋律模式。",
+"How many steps the sound solver takes to turn the music tokens into audio (flow matching, midpoint method). 32 is the release setting; 160 is the ceiling.\nEach step runs the sound model twice over the whole song, so 64 steps make this stage take twice as long as 32; the music itself (melody, words, length) is already fixed by then and does not change.\nFewer steps (8–16) are quicker drafts. Whether 64 sounds better than 32 has not been published: to hear it, re-render one take's sound at both settings.": "声音求解器把音乐 token 变成音频所走的步数（流匹配，中点法）。32 是发布版的设置；160 是上限。\n每一步都让声音模型在整首歌上跑两遍，所以 64 步会让这个阶段耗时为 32 步的两倍；音乐本身（旋律、歌词、时长）此时已经确定，不会改变。\n更少的步数（8–16）是更快的草稿。64 是否比 32 好听尚无公开结论：想听的话，用两种设置重新渲染同一个录音的声音。",
+"The words, with section tags such as [Verse], [Pre-Chorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro] on their own lines. The sections set the song's form, and together with the words its length: more sections, a longer song. Leave a blank line between sections. Lyrics count against the same budget as the style (see the counter under the style box).\nLines in (brackets) are part of the training form: 29 of the 110 official examples have them, as instrument cues (saxophone), (brass), (male), backing echoes (I'm so good) or section names. Their notes hold no \"Label:\", arrows or p/f marks.": "歌词，以及单独成行的段落标签，如 [Verse]、[Pre-Chorus]、[Chorus]、[Bridge]、[Outro]。段落决定歌曲的形式，并与歌词一起决定它的长度：段落越多，歌越长。段落之间空一行。歌词与风格计入同一个预算（见风格框下的计数器）。\n（括号）里的行是训练格式的一部分：110 个官方示例中有 29 个带有它们，用作乐器提示 (saxophone)、(brass)、(male)、和声回声 (I'm so good) 或段落名。其中没有“Label:”、箭头或 p/f 记号。",
+"Classifier-free guidance, for the music stage only (the score planner never uses it). Default 1.6 in every mode: Viktor's stable set (01.10.2026). The release had 1.0 in Full and Melody mode and 1.01 in Direct.\nAbove 1 the music follows the style prompt more strongly; in Full and Melody mode the score is kept either way. Any value other than 1.0 runs two passes per step: half the speed and twice the memory for the music stage. 1.0 switches guidance off: one pass, the release's sound.\n✓ 1.4–1.8 for steadier words; the cover configs on r/StableDiffusion go from 1.2 to 2.0, set per song.\n⚠ Above 2 the timbre hardens and artifacts appear. The memory is the cache: guidance keeps a second, unconditioned pass beside every version, 2.8 GB more each at the full context.": "无分类器引导，只用于音乐阶段（乐谱规划器从不使用）。所有模式下默认 1.6：Viktor 的稳定设置（01.10.2026）。发布版在完整和旋律模式下为 1.0，在直接模式下为 1.01。\n高于 1 时音乐更紧跟风格提示词；在完整和旋律模式下乐谱无论如何都会保留。1.0 以外的任何值每步都跑两遍：音乐阶段速度减半、显存翻倍。1.0 关闭引导：一遍，发布版的声音。\n✓ 想让歌词更稳用 1.4–1.8；r/StableDiffusion 上的翻唱配置为 1.2 到 2.0，按歌设置。\n⚠ 超过 2 时音色变硬并出现瑕疵。显存的去向是缓存：引导在每个版本旁保留第二遍无条件计算，在完整上下文下每个多 2.8 GB。",
+"How the sound stage walks from noise to audio (HERESY 1004). Measured on one song against a 160-step reference, error at the same cost of 64 network calls: Midpoint 32 steps 3.8e-3 (the release), Multistep 64 steps 3.5e-3, Heun 32 steps 6.5e-3, Euler 64 steps 3.0e-2.\nMidpoint: two network calls a step, second order — the release, and a strong default.\nMultistep: one call a step, second order (Adams-Bashforth 2, the idea behind DPM++ 2M): the same accuracy per call, and any step count, not only doubled ones.\nHeun: two calls, second order; less accurate than Midpoint at 32–64 steps, catches up only at many steps.\nEuler: one call, first order — ten times rougher at the same cost; for quick drafts.\nLower error means closer to what the model meant, not necessarily a sound you prefer: listen.": "声音阶段从噪声走到音频的方式（HERESY 1004）。在一首歌上对照 160 步的参考测得，同为 64 次网络调用成本时的误差：中点法 32 步 3.8e-3（发布版）、多步 64 步 3.5e-3、Heun 32 步 6.5e-3、欧拉 64 步 3.0e-2。\n中点法：每步两次网络调用，二阶 —— 发布版，也是可靠的默认值。\n多步：每步一次调用，二阶（Adams-Bashforth 2，DPM++ 2M 背后的思路）：每次调用的精度相同，步数可任意设置，不限于加倍的数。\nHeun：两次调用，二阶；在 32–64 步时不如中点法精确，步数很多时才赶上。\n欧拉：一次调用，一阶 —— 同样成本下粗糙十倍；用于快速草稿。\n误差更低意味着更接近模型的本意，不一定是你更喜欢的声音：请听。",
+"What the song should sound like, as short comma-separated phrases: language, genre, singer (e.g. female alto, raspy male), instruments, mood, tempo (e.g. 92 BPM). Both the score planner and the music read it; it goes in as the prompt's tag list, verbatim.\n✓ Agreement with the score first (HERESY 1012, measured 30.09.2026): the same style with key, meter and tempo set to the score sang clearer (0.74 against 0.60 on lyric recognition), most of all in the first minute. Tempo, meter and key live in the score.\n✓ Length: up to about 1,600 characters reads well; a long style that agreed with the score did as well as a 292-character one. The 110 official examples run 4 to 999 characters, median 124.\n⚠ Plain ASCII arrows (->) read cleanly; the Unicode arrow (→) is a rare token, write -> instead. Dynamics marks (p, f, ff) and \"Label:\" fields are in none of the official styles; the counter under the box flags them.\nSize: no fixed limit in the engine. Style and lyrics share the 24,576-token window with the score and the song; the counter keeps count.": "歌曲应有的声音，用逗号分隔的短语描述：语言、流派、歌手（例如 female alto、raspy male）、乐器、情绪、速度（例如 92 BPM）。乐谱规划器和音乐都会读它；它原样作为提示词的标签列表输入。\n✓ 首先要与乐谱一致（HERESY 1012，30.09.2026 实测）：调性、拍号和速度按乐谱设置的同一风格唱得更清楚（歌词识别 0.74 对 0.60），第一分钟尤甚。速度、拍号和调性都在乐谱里。\n✓ 长度：约 1,600 个字符以内读得好；与乐谱一致的长风格和 292 个字符的风格效果一样好。110 个官方示例为 4 到 999 个字符，中位数 124。\n⚠ 普通的 ASCII 箭头（->）读得干净；Unicode 箭头（→）是罕见 token，请改写成 ->。力度记号（p、f、ff）和“Label:”字段在官方风格中都没有；框下的计数器会标出它们。\n大小：引擎没有固定上限。风格和歌词与乐谱和歌曲共用 24,576 token 的窗口；计数器会统计。",
