+"measuring…": "正在测量…",
+"Could not measure: {0}": "无法测量：{0}",
+"What YuE2 was asked to play, one instrument or one style at a time, in probes of two minutes (one minute for the first ones), two seeds each, A and B. Click a name to put it into the Style prompt; ▶ plays its probe; its seeds stand under it. ✓ marks what the ear heard and kept, red what YuE2 did not play when named alone. An instrument shapes the style of the whole piece: naming one moves the arrangement too. A crackle or a rustle of paper, as on a worn record, is an unlucky seed: make it again on another.": "让 YuE2 演奏的内容，一次一种乐器或一种风格，两分钟的样例（最早的是一分钟），每个两个种子，A 和 B。点击名称把它放进风格提示；▶ 播放它的样例；种子写在下面。✓ 表示耳朵听到并保留的，红色表示单独点名时 YuE2 没有演奏的。一种乐器会塑造整首曲子的风格：点名一种乐器也会改变编曲。像旧唱片那样的噼啪声或纸张沙沙声，是运气不好的种子：换一个种子重做。",
+"Checking": "检查中",
+"asking the server": "正在询问服务器",
+"connecting": "正在连接",
+"none yet": "暂无",
+"Repeat": "重复",
+"shuffle": "随机",
+"Saved styles…": "已保存的风格…",
+"Put in a random music seed": "放入一个随机音乐种子",
+"Put in a random sound seed": "放入一个随机声音种子",
+"a kind, the knobs, a card": "一种类型、各项设置、一张显卡",
+"Asking the chat server…": "正在询问聊天服务器…",
+"Unload model: drop every idle model from GPU memory now (tinted red while a model is loaded)": "卸载模型：立即把每个空闲模型从显存中移除（加载着模型时呈红色）",
+"The key the song is in: the score's K:. With a score in the form, a choice moves it there; without one, the choice waits and moves the score that comes (a plan, a Retake, a transcription).": "歌曲所在的调：乐谱的 K:。表单中有乐谱时，选择会把它移调过去；没有时，选择会等待，并移调接下来的乐谱（规划、重录、扒谱）。",
+"Try it from Lyrics": "从歌词试试",
+"Favourites": "收藏",
+"Keep models loaded": "保持模型加载",
+"is the official YuE2 recipe for a song with no singing.": "是 YuE2 官方给无人声歌曲的配方。",
+"A score is planned as usual: your lyrics shape the melody and sections (with no lyrics, a plain Intro, Verse, Chorus, Outro).": "乐谱照常规划：你的歌词塑造旋律和段落（没有歌词时，就是简单的前奏、主歌、副歌、尾奏）。",
+"Every vocal note then moves to the instrument voice, keeping its pitch and timing; instrument notes under it give way.": "然后每个人声音符移到乐器声部，保留音高和节奏；它下面的乐器音符让位。",
+"The song renders from that score with only the section tags as lyrics, and": "歌曲从这份乐谱渲染，只用段落标签作为歌词，并且",
+"added to your style.": "加入你的风格。",
+"Full mode when the score has chords, Melody mode when it has none (a melody transcription).": "乐谱有和弦时用完整模式，没有时用旋律模式（旋律扒谱）。",
+"With a score already under": "如果已经有一份乐谱在",
+"(planned, pasted or transcribed from a recording), that score is converted instead. Your style and lyrics fields stay as you wrote them.": "（规划、粘贴或从录音扒谱而来），则转换的是那份乐谱。你的风格和歌词栏保持你写的样子。",
+"LoRA · add-on, not stock": "LoRA · 附加，非原装",
+"A LoRA is a small file of weight changes someone trained on a style, a genre or an artist. It is added into the model for this song, then taken out again.": "LoRA 是一个小文件，里面是有人针对某种风格、流派或艺人训练出的权重改动。它会为这首歌加进模型，之后再取出。",
+"the half that writes the score and the music tokens: melody, words, arrangement": "写乐谱和音乐令牌的那一半：旋律、歌词、编曲",
+"the half that turns them into audio: timbre, mix, production": "把它们变成音频的那一半：音色、混音、制作",
+"1 is the strength it was trained at, 0 turns that half off. Above 1 on the music half the vocal often falls apart; if a style comes out too strong, try 0.5 there first. Several can be stacked.": "1 是训练时的强度，0 关闭那一半。音乐部分超过 1 时人声常会崩坏；如果某种风格出来太强，先在那里试 0.5。可以叠加多个。",
+"Many LoRAs need their trigger word in the style prompt, and were trained in one planning mode; the hints below say so when the file does. Files live in the app's": "许多 LoRA 需要在风格提示里写上触发词，而且是在单一规划模式下训练的；文件里写明时，下面的提示会说出来。文件放在应用的",
+"folder (files, folders or links); community ones are mostly CC BY-NC.": "文件夹中（文件、文件夹或链接）；社区制作的大多是 CC BY-NC。",
+"VAE · sound decoder": "VAE · 声音解码器",
+"The last step of every song. The model writes the song as a compact description, and the VAE turns it into audio. It changes the tone and clarity, not the notes. One per song.": "每首歌的最后一步。模型把歌写成紧凑的描述，VAE 再把它变成音频。它改变音色和清晰度，而不改变音符。每首歌一个。",
+"current official, best sound": "当前官方，音质最好",
+"older official, used for the published scores": "较早的官方，用于公开的评分",
+"community mix, ⅔ Standard + ⅓ Legacy": "社区混合，⅔ Standard + ⅓ Legacy",
+"A finished song can get another VAE version from its page, in seconds.": "完成的歌曲可以在它的页面上几秒内得到另一个 VAE 版本。",
+"Sliders · add-on, not stock": "滑块 · 附加，非原装",
+"None of these ship with the model: all of them are one outside maker's add-on (its link and details are in Engine › Sliders). Each nudges the song model toward a voice or a genre while it writes the music, so they change what is played, not just how it sounds.": "这些都不随模型提供：全部是一位外部作者的附加组件（链接和详情在 引擎 › 滑块）。每一个都在写音乐时把歌曲模型推向某种声音或流派，所以它们改变的是演奏的内容，而不只是音色。",
+"A cousin of a LoRA, not a LoRA: a small trained network that adapts its push to the music as it goes, so it runs live beside the model instead of being merged in. Each one active slows the music stage a little.": "LoRA 的近亲，但不是 LoRA：一个小型训练网络，随着音乐进行调整推力，因此在模型旁边实时运行，而不是合并进去。每启用一个，音乐阶段就会慢一点。",
+"Tap to add; 0 is off, 1 is full; stack as many as you like. Trained in Direct mode; applied only while the music tokens are written, never to the score or the sound. Experimental.": "点击添加；0 为关闭，1 为最大；想叠多少都行。以直接模式训练；只在写音乐令牌时生效，从不作用于乐谱或声音。实验性。",
+"Backbone file": "主干文件",
+"the release weights, as published (about 7.2 GB)": "发布的权重，原样（约 7.2 GB）",
+"smaller quantized copies: less memory, slightly different numbers": "更小的量化副本：内存更少，数值略有不同",
+"Switching drops the old file from memory; the next song loads the new one.": "切换会把旧文件移出内存；下一首歌加载新的。",
+"Context size · key/value cache": "上下文大小 · 键值缓存",
+"0 keeps the whole 24,576 rows. Smaller saves GPU memory, but it must hold the prompt, the score and the song: roughly 2,500 rows plus 25 for every second of music.": "0 保留全部 24,576 行。更小可以节省显存，但必须装得下提示、乐谱和歌曲：大约 2,500 行，再加每秒音乐 25 行。",
+"VAE tile frames: the decoder works on tiles of this size. Smaller tiles need less memory at the same speed; 512 is the reference setting.": "VAE 分块帧数：解码器按这个大小的块处理。块越小，速度不变而所需内存越少；512 是参考设置。",
+"Off": "关",
+"On": "开",
+"each stage loads, runs and leaves GPU memory; the card is free again after every song": "每个阶段加载、运行，然后离开显存；每首歌后显卡都会再次空出",
+"everything stays resident, so the next song starts at once": "全部常驻，下一首歌立即开始",
+"The C++ counterpart of the other console's \"offload\" choice.": "另一个控制台“offload”选项的 C++ 对应项。",
+"Transcription models": "扒谱模型",
+"listens to the recording": "聆听录音",
+"writes what it hears as a score": "把听到的写成乐谱",
+"Both run inside the server from one converted file, in its queue like a song. The score loads into \"Supply your own score\" and the song model follows it. WAV and MP3 go up as they are; other formats are converted in the browser first.": "两者都在服务器内从同一个转换后的文件运行，像歌曲一样排队。乐谱会进入“提供你自己的乐谱”，歌曲模型随之演奏。WAV 和 MP3 原样上传；其他格式先在浏览器中转换。",
+"Two seeds": "两个种子",
+"the token draw: the score, the melody and the length come from this one": "令牌抽取：乐谱、旋律和长度都来自这个",
+"the acoustic noise: the same music played through a different grain": "声学噪声：同样的音乐以不同的颗粒感演奏",
+"Blank rolls a random one. Every take keeps both, so it can be replayed exactly, or given a new sound in seconds without writing the music again.": "留空则随机。每个录音都保存两者，所以可以精确重放，或在几秒内换个新声音而无需重写音乐。",
+"Output": "输出",
+"the fair comparison with the other console's 24-bit files": "与另一个控制台的 24 位文件公平比较",
+"raw float, no normalisation": "原始浮点，不做归一化",
+"small files; the server's own default": "文件小；服务器自己的默认",
+"normalises to the peak left after ignoring this many samples per million; 0 is the true peak": "忽略每百万这么多个采样后，按剩下的峰值归一化；0 为真实峰值",
+"Sound variations render the same music with seeds sound + 1, + 2… side by side.": "声音变体用种子 声音 + 1、+ 2… 并排渲染同样的音乐。",
+"How many songs to make from this prompt: separate songs, each with its own music seed (seed, seed + 1…). The server writes up to": "用这个提示生成几首歌：互相独立的歌，每首有自己的音乐种子（种子、种子 + 1…）。服务器一次最多并排写",
+"side by side in one pass; more are queued as further passes.": "首；其余的在后续批次中等待。",
+"Sampling and Denoising": "采样与去噪",
+"Songs": "歌曲",
+"Sounds": "声音",
+"About songs": "关于歌曲",
+"About sounds": "关于声音",
+"How many different songs Generate makes from this prompt, each with its own music seed (seed, seed + 1…). The server writes up to": "“生成”用这个提示生成几首不同的歌，每首有自己的音乐种子（种子、种子 + 1…）。服务器一次最多并排写",
+"side by side in one pass; more wait as further passes, so a larger number only takes longer.": "首；其余的在后续批次中等待，所以数字更大只是更费时间。",
+"How many times each song's sound is rendered from its one music, each with its own sound seed (seed, seed + 1…, the same for every song). A song's sounds are made all at once, side by side: this is what fills the card's memory, so the ceiling follows the card, the model copy and the song's length.": "每首歌的声音从同一份音乐渲染几次，每次有自己的声音种子（种子、种子 + 1…，每首歌都一样）。一首歌的各个声音一次并排生成：这正是占满显存的部分，所以上限取决于显卡、模型副本和歌曲长度。",
+"Songs × Sounds is how many takes come out: 2 × 4 = 8, music m and m + 1, each with sounds s to s + 3.": "歌曲 × 声音 就是产出的录音数：2 × 4 = 8，音乐 m 和 m + 1，每个带声音 s 到 s + 3。",
+"Probes": "样例",
+"Variations": "变体",
+"About probes": "关于样例",
+"About variations": "关于变体",
+"How many probes Generate makes from this prompt: each one is the music written anew, with its own music seed (seed, seed + 1…). The server writes up to": "“生成”用这个提示生成几个样例：每个都是重新写的音乐，有自己的音乐种子（种子、种子 + 1…）。服务器一次最多并排写",
+"How many times each probe's sound is rendered from its one music, each with its own sound seed (seed, seed + 1…, the same for every probe). A probe's variations are made in one pass; each costs about the time of one sound, hardly any memory.": "每个样例的声音从同一份音乐渲染几次，每次有自己的声音种子（种子、种子 + 1…，每个样例都一样）。一个样例的变体在一个批次中完成；每个大约花一次声音的时间，几乎不占内存。",
+"Probes × Variations is how many takes come out: 2 × 4 = 8, music m and m + 1, each with sounds s to s + 3.": "样例 × 变体 就是产出的录音数：2 × 4 = 8，音乐 m 和 m + 1，每个带声音 s 到 s + 3。",
+"16 voice and genre sliders (Female, Male, Pop, Metal, Country and more): an add-on by a third party, not the model's publisher. None ship with the model. Each is a small trained adapter on the music half, a cousin of a LoRA: instead of one fixed weight change it routes the model's signal through a tiny learned network, so its push adapts to the music. That is why it runs live while the music is written instead of being merged in, and why each one slows that stage a little. 0 is off, 1 is the trained sound; negative is not supported. Its makers mark the set experimental.": "16 个声音与流派滑块（女声、男声、流行、金属、乡村等）：第三方的附加组件，而不是模型发布者的。都不随模型提供。每个都是在音乐部分上训练的小适配器，是 LoRA 的近亲：它不是固定的权重改动，而是让模型的信号经过一个小小的学习网络，所以推力会随音乐变化。这就是为什么它在写音乐时实时运行而不是被合并进去，也是为什么每个都会让那个阶段慢一点。0 为关闭，1 为训练的声音；不支持负值。作者把这套标为实验性。",
+"Artist-style LoRA for close, hushed vocals, heavy low end and off-kilter bedroom pop. Both halves; start at 1.0. Its card says to begin the style with \"sv_billie, in the style of sv_billie.\" and give full section-tagged lyrics; it used 100 sound steps.": "艺人风格 LoRA，适合贴近而轻声的人声、厚重的低频和古怪的卧室流行。两半都作用；从 1.0 开始。它的卡片说风格要以“sv_billie, in the style of sv_billie.”开头，并给出带段落标签的完整歌词；它用了 100 个声音步数。",
+"DreamPop v2: a style LoRA toward dream pop (hazy, washed guitars, soft vocals). Both halves. Put its trigger sv_dreampop in the style. Its settings file asks for Direct mode (no score), guidance 1 and 32 sound steps.": "DreamPop v2：偏向梦幻流行的风格 LoRA（朦胧、被冲洗过的吉他、柔和人声）。两半都作用。把触发词 sv_dreampop 写进风格。它的设置文件要求直接模式（无乐谱）、引导 1 和 32 个声音步数。",
+"Industrial rock, music half: steers structure, melody and genre toward heavy distorted guitars, mechanical textures and aggressive rhythms (trained on 179 tracks). Pair it with adapter-nar-179-v2 for the sound. Card: music about 1.0.": "工业摇滚，音乐部分：把结构、旋律和流派引向沉重失真的吉他、机械质感和激进节奏（在 179 条音轨上训练）。声音请配 adapter-nar-179-v2。卡片：音乐约 1.0。",
+"Industrial rock, sound half: the timbre (dense, distorted, mechanical). v2 is the retrain with the training bug fixed, the recommended one. Card: keep sound at 0.3 to 0.7; well above 1.0 it turns into noise.": "工业摇滚，声音部分：音色（密集、失真、机械）。v2 是修正了训练错误后的重训版，推荐使用。卡片：声音保持在 0.3 到 0.7；远高于 1.0 会变成噪声。",
+"Modern J-pop timbre, sound half only: bright guitars, warm bass, shimmering synths, polished production. Put its trigger jpstyle26 first in the style. Small training run (2000 steps on 6-second clips).": "现代 J-pop 音色，仅声音部分：明亮的吉他、温暖的贝斯、闪烁的合成器、精致的制作。把触发词 jpstyle26 放在风格最前面。小规模训练（在 6 秒片段上 2000 步）。",
+"Real-production sound, sound half: makes the decoder render like real recorded music instead of the model's own polish. Also swaps two small bridge layers. v4 is the earlier round, the one the instrumental LoRA's renders used. Use at sound 1.0; no trigger.": "真实制作的声音，声音部分：让解码器渲染得像真正录制的音乐，而不是模型自己的润色。还替换了两个小的桥接层。v4 是较早的一轮，器乐 LoRA 的渲染用的就是它。在声音 1.0 下使用；无触发词。",
+"Real-production sound, sound half, newest round (v9): trained against the actual audio of real recordings, not just a proxy, and preferred overall in its authors' listening tests over v4 to v8. Use at sound 1.0; no trigger. Pick v4 or v9, not both.": "真实制作的声音，声音部分，最新一轮（v9）：针对真实录音的实际音频训练，而不只是替代品，在作者的试听测试中总体优于 v4 到 v8。在声音 1.0 下使用；无触发词。v4 和 v9 选一个，不要同时用。",
+"Epic trailer orchestra, music half: soaring strings, taiko and orchestral percussion, brass fanfares, big choir (trained on 195 tracks). Pair it with adapter-nar-194. The card's sample used music about 0.5.": "史诗预告片管弦乐，音乐部分：高扬的弦乐、太鼓和管弦乐打击乐、铜管号角、大合唱（在 195 条音轨上训练）。请配 adapter-nar-194。卡片的示例用的音乐约 0.5。",
+"Epic trailer orchestra, sound half: the big symphonic timbre. The card's sample used sound about 0.375; keep it at 0.3 to 0.7, higher turns harsh or hollow.": "史诗预告片管弦乐，声音部分：宏大的交响音色。卡片的示例用的声音约 0.375；保持在 0.3 到 0.7，更高会变得刺耳或空洞。",
+"Instrumental music with a section plan, music half (trained on about 2,700 instrumental tracks). Use Full plan mode. Lyrics box: only bare section tags, one per line ([intro] [verse] [chorus] [bridge] [outro]), optionally with m:ss times. Pair it with a real-audio sound LoRA for real-production sound.": "带段落规划的器乐，音乐部分（在约 2,700 条器乐音轨上训练）。使用完整规划模式。歌词栏：只写光秃的段落标签，每行一个（[intro] [verse] [chorus] [bridge] [outro]），可选带 m:ss 时间。想要真实制作的声音，请配一个真实音频的声音 LoRA。",
+"Melodic death metal, music half (the step-600 checkpoint). Put its trigger deathmetal in the style. The card gives no strength advice: start at 1.0 and lower it if vocals fall apart.": "旋律死亡金属，音乐部分（第 600 步的检查点）。把触发词 deathmetal 写进风格。卡片没有给出强度建议：从 1.0 开始，人声崩坏就调低。",
