+"Show disliked": "显示点踩的",
+"The disliked ones too": "点踩的也显示",
+"A dislike hides a take from the lists, as SUNO does; nothing is deleted. Ticked, the disliked show too; the 👎 chip shows only them": "点踩会像 SUNO 那样把录音从列表中隐藏；不删除任何东西。勾选后点踩的也显示；👎 标签只显示它们",
+"“{0}” disliked: it leaves the lists; nothing is deleted (“Show disliked” brings it back)": "已点踩“{0}”：它离开列表；不删除任何东西（“显示点踩的”可找回）",
+"Warning": "警告",
+"Characters: {#0} · tokens: ≈{#1} · with the lyrics: ≈{#2} of {#3}": "字符：{#0} · 令牌：≈{#1} · 含歌词：≈{#2}/{#3}",
+"What to expect: YuE2 learned from styles without these, and the engine hands the style over word for word. What the model never saw can come out sung as words, or pull the sound away from the style. Written as the official styles are, the style holds.": "预期：YuE2 是在不含这些内容的风格上学习的，引擎会逐字传递风格。模型从未见过的东西可能会被当作歌词唱出来，或让声音偏离风格。按官方风格那样写，风格就能保持。",
+"What to expect: the style, the lyrics, the score and the song share one window of 24,576 tokens; past the budget the score or the song is cut short.": "预期：风格、歌词、乐谱和歌曲共用一个 24,576 令牌的窗口；超出预算时乐谱或歌曲会被截断。",
+"The score's and the song's token budgets alone fill the window of 24,576 tokens: nothing is left for the style and the lyrics. Lower max tokens under Score sampling or Music sampling, or Max length.": "乐谱和歌曲的令牌预算本身就占满了 24,576 令牌的窗口：没给风格和歌词留下任何空间。请降低乐谱采样或音乐采样下的最多令牌，或最大时长。",
+"Only the liked": "只看点赞的",
+"Only the disliked: a dislike hides a take from the lists, as SUNO does (nothing is deleted); this shows them": "只看点踩的：点踩会像 SUNO 那样把录音从列表中隐藏（不删除任何东西）；这里显示它们",
+"“{0}” disliked: it leaves the lists; nothing is deleted (the 👎 filter shows it)": "已点踩“{0}”：它离开列表；不删除任何东西（👎 筛选可显示它）",
+"Artwork": "封面图",
+"artwork": "封面图",
+"Painter": "画师",
+"Who paints a take's artwork: the player's, the cards', the MP3's cover. A drawing waits in the queue for a card with room.": "谁来画录音的封面图：播放器的、卡片的、MP3 的封面。绘制会在队列中等待有空间的显卡。",
+"Krea 2 Muse paints instruments and scenes far truer than SDXL (the studio's A/B on twelve instruments, 05.10.2026); SDXL is for cards it does not fit": "Krea 2 Muse 画乐器和场景远比 SDXL 真实（工作室在十二种乐器上的 A/B，05.10.2026）；SDXL 用于放不下它的显卡",
+"By the cards: Krea 2 Muse Q4 from 16 GB, else SDXL": "按显卡：16 GB 起用 Krea 2 Muse Q4，否则用 SDXL",
+"Krea 2 Muse · Q4 · about 12 GB · about 25 s a picture": "Krea 2 Muse · Q4 · 约 12 GB · 每张约 25 秒",
+"Krea 2 Muse · Q8 · about 18 GB · about 22 s a picture": "Krea 2 Muse · Q8 · 约 18 GB · 每张约 22 秒",
+"SDXL CyberRealistic · about 15 GB · about 10 s a picture": "SDXL CyberRealistic · 约 15 GB · 每张约 10 秒",
+"Krea 2 Muse by": "Krea 2 Muse，作者",
+", a fine-tune of": "，微调自",
+"(Krea 2 Community License: its pictures pass a content filter); SDXL: CyberRealistic XL by Cyberdelia. Times on an RTX 3090, the prompt and the look-over not counted.": "（Krea 2 Community License：其图片要通过内容过滤）；SDXL：Cyberdelia 的 CyberRealistic XL。时间在 RTX 3090 上测得，不含提示和审看。",
+"Artwork: Krea 2 Muse by Stable Yogi": "封面图：Stable Yogi 的 Krea 2 Muse",
+"Artwork: Krea 2, by Krea": "封面图：Krea 的 Krea 2",
+"Artwork on smaller cards: CyberRealistic XL by Cyberdelia": "小显卡上的封面图：Cyberdelia 的 CyberRealistic XL",
+"Drawing artwork for “{0}”: a prompt from its style and words, then the picture (a minute or two)": "正在为“{0}”绘制封面图：先从它的风格和歌词写出提示，再画图（一两分钟）",
+"a minute or two on a GPU": "在 GPU 上一两分钟",
+"Artwork from now on: {0}": "今后的封面图：{0}",
+"Artwork: the painter by the cards": "封面图：按显卡选画师",
+"Direct mode writes no score: choose Full plan or Melody only to plan one": "直接模式不写乐谱：要规划乐谱请选完整规划或仅旋律",
+"Clear the form?": "清空表单？",
+"Its title, style, lyrics, score and every knob go back to the defaults. The takes stay.": "标题、风格、歌词、乐谱和每个设置都恢复默认。录音保留。",
+"Min length": "最短时长",
+"Max length of the music": "音乐的最大时长",
+"Min length of the music": "音乐的最短时长",
+"It follows Max length in Sound and output: 25 music tokens a second": "它跟随“声音与输出”中的最大时长：每秒 25 个音乐令牌",
+"The music's Min length may not pass its Max length (Max length in Sound and output)": "音乐的最短时长不能超过最大时长（“声音与输出”中的最大时长）",
+"Above 2 the choice is close to random; below 0.1 it is nearly fixed and loops.": "高于 2 时选择接近随机；低于 0.1 时几乎固定并循环。",
+"Below 0.5 only a few of the likeliest tokens stay, and the line turns monotone.": "低于 0.5 时只剩少数最可能的令牌，旋律线变得单调。",
+"1 always takes the likeliest token; past 1000 it narrows nothing, top-p decides.": "1 总是取最可能的令牌；超过 1000 就不再限制，由 top-p 决定。",
+"1 switches it off; above 2 every repeat is avoided, and the song loses its refrains and its beat.": "1 关闭它；高于 2 会避免一切重复，歌曲会失去副歌和节拍。",
+"The engine looks back 100 tokens at most.": "引擎最多向后看 100 个令牌。",
+"The score's window holds 8,192 tokens.": "乐谱的窗口可容纳 8,192 个令牌。",
+"Below 256 a score has no room for its sections; past 8,192 it overflows its window.": "低于 256 时乐谱没有空间写段落；超过 8,192 会溢出窗口。",
+"The floor never goes above the music's Max length (Max length in Sound and output).": "下限从不超过音乐的最大时长（“声音与输出”中的最大时长）。",
+"The song's length at most, as m:ss (the music's tokens, 25 a second): songs end on their own before it, and the engine cuts a song to what fits in the window of 24,576 tokens beside the style, the lyrics and (outside Direct) the score.": "歌曲时长上限，m:ss（音乐令牌，每秒 25 个）：歌曲会在此之前自然结束，引擎会把歌曲截到与风格、歌词以及（非直接模式下的）乐谱一起能放进 24,576 令牌窗口的长度。",
+"The floor never goes above the music's Max length.": "下限从不超过音乐的最大时长。",
+"1.4–1.6 is the verified stable range; 2.0 is dynamic, closer to SUNO; up to 2.4 it holds. From 2.6 the music gets cut short and the lyrics suffer; 1.0 switches guidance off.": "1.4–1.6 是验证过的稳定范围；2.0 更有动感，更接近 SUNO；到 2.4 仍能保持。从 2.6 起音乐会被提前截断，歌词受损；1.0 关闭引导。",
+"32 is the release; 8–16 are quick drafts; 160 is the ceiling.": "32 是发布设置；8–16 是快速草稿；160 是上限。",
+"The model's whole window is 24,576 tokens (16:23 of sound), and the style, the lyrics and, outside Direct, the score take their share of it.": "模型的整个窗口是 24,576 个令牌（相当于 16:23 的声音），风格、歌词以及非直接模式下的乐谱各占一部分。",
+"One pass renders nine at most.": "一次最多渲染九个。",
+"0 normalises to the true peak; past 1000 (0.1% of the samples cut flat) the peaks distort.": "0 按真实峰值归一化；超过 1000（0.1% 的采样被削平）时峰值会失真。",
+"Guidance from 2.6 is an experiment": "2.6 起的引导属于实验",
+"The music gets cut short and the lyrics suffer, while the instruments come in clearer (Viktor's test in Direct mode, 05.10.2026). Stable: 1.4–1.6; 2.0 is dynamic, closer to SUNO; 2.4 is the edge.": "乐器更清晰，但音乐会被提前截断，歌词受损（Viktor 在直接模式下的测试，05.10.2026）。稳定：1.4–1.6；2.0 更有动感，更接近 SUNO；2.4 是边缘。",
+"Songs end on their own; Max length only caps them, and the engine cuts a song to what fits in the window of 24,576 tokens beside the style, the lyrics and (outside Direct) the score.": "歌曲会自然结束；最大时长只设上限，引擎会把歌曲截到与风格、歌词以及（非直接模式下的）乐谱一起能放进 24,576 令牌窗口的长度。",
+"Play new takes": "播放新录音",
+"Play new takes: a song made here plays when it is done, unless something plays. Click to only open it.": "播放新录音：在这里做的歌完成后会自动播放，除非正在播放别的。点击则只打开它。",
+"Download the picture": "下载图片",
+"Download the picture (JPEG)": "下载图片（JPEG）",
+"Send the request to LLM": "把请求发给 LLM",
+"Ctrl+Enter in the brief does the same": "在简报中按 Ctrl+Enter 也一样",
+"The song's token budget alone fills the window of 24,576 tokens: nothing is left for the style and the lyrics. Lower Max length.": "歌曲的令牌预算本身就占满了 24,576 令牌的窗口：没给风格和歌词留下空间。请降低最大时长。",
+"Style and lyrics together: about {#0} tokens. Beside them the window holds about {1} of sound, and Max length asks for {2}: the engine cuts the song there and marks it truncated.": "风格和歌词合计：约 {#0} 个令牌。除此之外窗口还能容纳约 {1} 的声音，而最大时长要求 {2}：引擎会在那里截断歌曲并标记为已截断。",
+"Classifier-free guidance, for the music stage only (the score planner never uses it). Default 1.6 in every mode: Viktor's stable set (01.10.2026). The release had 1.0 in Full and Melody mode and 1.01 in Direct. Above 1 the music follows the style prompt more strongly; in Full and Melody mode the score is kept either way. Any value other than 1.0 runs two passes per step: half the speed and twice the memory for the music stage. 1.0 switches guidance off: one pass, the release's sound. ✓ 1.4–1.6: the verified stable range. 2.0: dynamic, closer to SUNO. Up to 2.4 it still holds. ⚠ From 2.6 the music gets cut short and the lyrics suffer (the same illness as SUNO's): the higher the guidance, the clearer the instruments come in and the more the words pay for it; how soon depends on how complex the style and the lyrics are (Viktor's test in Direct mode, 05.10.2026). The field takes 1.0–4.0; the engine itself sets no ceiling. The memory is the cache: guidance keeps a second, unconditioned pass beside every version, 2.8 GB more each at the full context.": "无分类器引导，只用于音乐阶段（乐谱规划从不使用）。所有模式默认 1.6：Viktor 的稳定设置（01.10.2026）。发布版在完整规划和旋律模式为 1.0，直接模式为 1.01。高于 1 时音乐更强地遵循风格提示；在完整规划和旋律模式下，乐谱无论如何都会保留。除 1.0 以外的任何值每步要跑两遍：音乐阶段速度减半、内存翻倍。1.0 关闭引导：一遍，发布版的声音。✓ 1.4–1.6：验证过的稳定范围。2.0：有动感，更接近 SUNO。到 2.4 仍能保持。⚠ 从 2.6 起音乐会被提前截断，歌词受损（和 SUNO 一样的毛病）：引导越高，乐器越清晰，歌词付出的代价也越大；多早出现取决于风格和歌词的复杂程度（Viktor 在直接模式下的测试，05.10.2026）。该栏接受 1.0–4.0；引擎本身不设上限。内存就是缓存：引导会在每个版本旁保留第二个无条件的一遍，满上下文时每个多 2.8 GB。",
+"Sets Guidance (CFG): 1.2 · 1.4 · 1.6 (the middle, the default) · 1.8 · 2.0. Higher follows the style prompt more strongly. 1.4–1.6 is the verified stable range; 2.0 is dynamic, closer to SUNO. Every position runs the music stage's two passes (half the speed, twice the memory). ⚠ Past 2.0 only by hand in Guidance: up to 2.4 it holds, from 2.6 the music gets cut short and the lyrics suffer.": "设置引导（CFG）：1.2 · 1.4 · 1.6（中间值，默认）· 1.8 · 2.0。越高越强地遵循风格提示。1.4–1.6 是验证过的稳定范围；2.0 更有动感，更接近 SUNO。每个档位都会让音乐阶段跑两遍（速度减半，内存翻倍）。⚠ 高于 2.0 只能在“引导”中手动输入：到 2.4 仍能保持，从 2.6 起音乐会被提前截断、歌词受损。",
+"A ceiling on the song's length in seconds (480 by default; 0:10–16:00): the music stage stops at 25 tokens per second of this (Sampling shows it as the music's Max length). The length itself comes from the lyrics and the score; this only cuts a runaway song short (it is then marked truncated).": "歌曲时长的上限，单位秒（默认 480；0:10–16:00）：音乐阶段在每秒 25 个令牌处停止（采样中显示为音乐的最大时长）。时长本身由歌词和乐谱决定；这只是截断失控的歌曲（届时会标记为已截断）。",
+"The score cannot end before this many tokens. Default 200. ✓ Leave it.": "乐谱不能在这么多令牌之前结束。默认 200。✓ 保持不变。",
+"The song cannot end before this, set in time: 25 music tokens a second, the default 0:30 is 750 tokens. ✓ Leave it.": "歌曲不能在此之前结束，以时间设定：每秒 25 个音乐令牌，默认 0:30 即 750 个令牌。✓ 保持不变。",
+"The longest song: it follows Max length in Sound and output, 25 music tokens a second (8:00 is 12,000). ✓ Set Max length close to the length the lyrics need. ⚠ Much more room than the lyrics need, and after the last line the model goes back and sings earlier lines again (measured: 24 such returns after the lyrics ended). A song cut off here is marked truncated.": "最长的歌曲：它跟随“声音与输出”中的最大时长，每秒 25 个音乐令牌（8:00 即 12,000）。✓ 把最大时长设得接近歌词所需的长度。⚠ 留出远多于歌词所需的空间时，模型在最后一行之后会回头再唱前面的行（实测：歌词结束后出现 24 次这样的回跳）。在这里被截断的歌曲会标记为已截断。",
+"Only the disliked (a dislike hides a take everywhere else)": "只看点踩的（点踩会在其他所有地方隐藏录音）",
+"Start a new song?": "开始一首新歌？",
+"Its title, style, lyrics, score, seeds, the mode, sampling, sliders and LoRAs go back to the defaults. Sound and output (VAE, solver, steps, length, format) and the takes stay.": "标题、风格、歌词、乐谱、种子、模式、采样、滑块和 LoRA 恢复默认。“声音与输出”（VAE、求解器、步数、时长、格式）和录音保留。",
