+"All the sound strengths together. By ear (05.10.2026): two adapters at sound 1.0 each, 2.0 together, brought a heavy bass; 0.55 together sounded right. Green to {0}, amber to {1}, red past it.": "所有声音强度的合计。凭耳朵（05.10.2026）：两个适配器各在声音 1.0，合计 2.0，带来了沉重的低音；合计 0.55 听起来正好。到 {0} 为绿，到 {1} 为琥珀，再高为红。",
