+"Remember the key in this browser. Otherwise it lives only until the page is closed. The page sends it to openrouter.ai and nowhere else: not to the studio, not into its settings file.": "在此浏览器中记住密钥。否则它只保存到页面关闭为止。页面只把它发送到 openrouter.ai，不发往别处：既不发给工作室，也不写进它的设置文件。",
+"Any model of openrouter.ai/models, written provider/model. The field offers the list as you type; the quick picks fill it in.": "openrouter.ai/models 上的任意模型，写作 提供方/模型。输入时会给出列表；快速选择会自动填好。",
+"The section order the model gives new lyrics. «Keep mine» leaves the lyrics' own order.": "模型给新歌词的段落顺序。“保留我的”保持歌词自己的顺序。",
+"The draft's style as tags, the most important first, as an SD/SDXL prompt is written. «Into the form» chooses which of the two, the tags or the readable style, the draft puts in the Style field.": "草稿的风格写成标签，最重要的放前面，就像写 SD/SDXL 提示那样。“放进表单”选择草稿把两者中的哪一个——标签还是可读的风格——放进风格栏。",
+"Your saved briefs, kept by the lab (every browser sees them): picking one puts it in the box above.": "你保存的简报，由实验室保管（每个浏览器都能看到）：选择一个就会放进上面的框。",
