+"Unload idle models after": "空闲模型卸载时间",
+"How long the models stay in GPU memory with nothing to do: 15 minutes to 4 hours, by 15. Then the engine unloads them, and the next song loads them again.": "模型无事可做时在显存中停留多久：15 分钟到 4 小时，以 15 分钟为步长。之后引擎会卸载它们，下一首歌再重新加载。",
+"The models leave GPU memory 15 s after a song: time enough to send the next one while they are still loaded": "一首歌后 15 秒模型离开显存：足够在它们仍加载时发送下一首",
