+"Only the disliked": "只看点踩的",
+"The covers are painted by an image model: some show an instrument not quite as it really is.": "封面由图像模型绘制：有些乐器画得与实物并不完全一样。",
+"The instruments' covers are painted by an image model: some show an instrument not quite as it really is; the styles' covers are each take's own score.": "乐器的封面由图像模型绘制：有些乐器画得与实物并不完全一样；风格的封面是每个录音自己的乐谱。",
+"⚠ A name in the style is a request, not a promise.": "⚠ 风格里写的名字是请求，不是承诺。",
+"What ▶ A and ▶ B play is what YuE2 gives for it, about nine times in ten: trust the ear, not the name.": "▶ A 和 ▶ B 播放的是 YuE2 对它给出的声音，大约十次中有九次：相信耳朵，而不是名字。",
+"Click a name": "点击名称",
+"it goes into the Style prompt and onto the clipboard": "它会进入风格提示和剪贴板",
+"its two probes, their seeds under them": "它的两个样例，种子写在下面",
+"the ear heard it and kept it;": "耳朵听出并保留的；",
+"red": "红色",
+": not played when named alone": "：单独点名时没有演奏",
+"The pictures": "图片",
+"painted by an image model: some show an instrument not quite as it really is": "由图像模型绘制：有些乐器画得与实物并不完全一样",
+"How the probes were made": "样例是怎么做的",
+"What YuE2 was asked to play, one instrument or one style at a time, in probes of two minutes (one minute for the first ones), two seeds each, A and B. Some probes are superb, and A and B agree, yet the instrument is not the one asked for. An instrument shapes the style of the whole piece: naming one moves the arrangement too. A crackle or a rustle of paper, as on a worn record, is an unlucky seed: make it again on another.": "让 YuE2 演奏的内容，一次一种乐器或一种风格，两分钟的样例（最早的是一分钟），每个两个种子，A 和 B。有些样例非常出色，A 和 B 也一致，但乐器却不是所要的。一种乐器会塑造整首曲子的风格：点名一种乐器也会改变编曲。像旧唱片那样的噼啪声或纸张沙沙声，是运气不好的种子：换一个种子重做。",
+"What YuE2 was asked to play, one instrument or one style at a time, in probes of two minutes (one minute for the first ones), two seeds each, A and B. Some probes are superb, and A and B agree, yet the instrument is not the one asked for.": "让 YuE2 演奏的内容，一次一种乐器或一种风格，两分钟的样例（最早的是一分钟），每个两个种子，A 和 B。有些样例非常出色，A 和 B 也一致，但乐器却不是所要的。",
+"An instrument shapes the style of the whole piece: naming one moves the arrangement too.": "一种乐器会塑造整首曲子的风格：点名一种乐器也会改变编曲。",
+"A crackle or a rustle of paper, as on a worn record, is an unlucky seed: make it again on another.": "像旧唱片那样的噼啪声或纸张沙沙声，是运气不好的种子：换一个种子重做。",
+"{#0} heard by ear": "耳朵听过 {#0}",
+"Fails when named so: ask for it as the ancient triangular harp (the row below).": "用这个名字会失败：请把它当作古代三角竖琴来要（下面一行）。",
+"Probed many times, without success: YuE2 does not know the shofar. The probes always give another pipe or horn, never a shofar, not even close. Its probes (below) are kept: take one as the horn or trumpet it turned out to be. Its adapter knows it: loras/shofar-yt-r16 at epoch 110, Viktor's ear: «Mind-blowing: no shofar player has heard the like. A whole meditation. One hundred percent a Yemenite shofar, an antelope horn two metres long» (167 overtrained, weak and thin; 66 undertrained, a trumpet in it).": "试过很多次，都没成功：YuE2 不认识羊角号（shofar）。样例总是给出别的管或号，从来不是羊角号，连接近都谈不上。它的样例（下面）保留着：可以把它当作它实际变成的号角或小号来用。它的适配器认识它：loras/shofar-yt-r16 第 110 轮，Viktor 的耳朵：“震撼：没有哪位羊角号手听过这样的声音。完整的一段冥想。百分之百是也门羊角号，一支两米长的羚羊角”（167 过度训练，又弱又薄；66 训练不足，里面有小号）。",
+"Tested, Failed. Other pipe/horn discovered. B alone comes near a Yemenite shofar, a battle cry: still not a shofar.": "已测试，失败。发现了别的管/号。只有 B 接近也门羊角号，像战斗的呐喊：仍然不是羊角号。",
+"Tested, Failed. Other pipe/horn discovered.": "已测试，失败。发现了别的管/号。",
+"Tested, Failed. Other pipe/horn discovered. Dross, kept: a spark of heavy rock in it.": "已测试，失败。发现了别的管/号。渣滓，保留：里面有一点重摇滚的火花。",
+"Not like a horn either.": "也不像号角。",
+"Failed (Viktor 04.10: «unfortunately, YuE2 has no oboe»): no oboe in its probes.": "失败（Viktor 04.10：“可惜 YuE2 没有双簧管”）：它的样例里没有双簧管。",
+"No such reed: YuE2 does not play the bassoon. Both probes deleted.": "没有这种簧片：YuE2 不演奏巴松管。两个样例都已删除。",
+"Failed (Viktor 03.10: «the gong failed; deleting it»): no gong in its probes.": "失败（Viktor 03.10：“锣失败了；删掉”）：它的样例里没有锣。",
+"Fails: YuE2 gives no birdsong when asked for it alone (the 60 s probes and the 2-minute ones alike).": "失败：单独要时 YuE2 不给鸟鸣（60 秒和 2 分钟的样例都一样）。",
+"Not an instrument: a whole style (Viktor: «not an instrument, a whole style»). Styles → Summer cicadas.": "不是乐器：是一整种风格（Viktor：“不是乐器，是一整种风格”）。风格 → 夏日蝉鸣。",
