+"All together": "全部合计",
+"All the adapters' strengths together: stacked, they add up, and past about {#0} the picture burns (its colours and edges overdone), however modest each one is. Green to {#1}, amber to {#2}, red past it. Drag it to move them all at once, each in proportion.": "所有适配器的强度合计：叠加后会相加，超过约 {#0} 图片就会烧坏（颜色和边缘过度），无论每个多么温和。到 {#1} 为绿，到 {#2} 为琥珀，再高为红。拖动可一次移动全部，各自按比例。",
