+"Auto ({#0} GB found, its limit {#1} GB in Engine → GPUs: too small for YuE2)": "自动（检测到 {#0} GB，在 引擎 → GPU 中上限为 {#1} GB：对 YuE2 来说太小）",
+"The most of the card’s memory the studio’s work may take, the rest left to what else runs on it (a laptop’s desktop and browser): Compute’s Auto plans the engine’s knobs for the studio card’s limit, and the lab gives a card a job only when it fits under its limit": "工作室的工作最多可占用的显卡内存，其余留给显卡上运行的其他程序（笔记本的桌面和浏览器）：计算 的自动设置按工作室显卡的上限规划引擎参数，实验室只在任务能放进上限时才把它交给显卡",
