+"⚠ {0}: {#1} on the music half is past its limit {#2}: the score tends to fail after 70-200 tokens.": "⚠ {0}：音乐部分的 {#1} 超过上限 {#2}：乐谱往往在 70-200 个令牌后出错。",
+"⚠ {0}: {#1} on the sound half is past its limit {#2}.": "⚠ {0}：声音部分的 {#1} 超过上限 {#2}。",
+"⚠ The sound half carries {#0} together: by ear, 2.0 together brought a heavy bass (05.10.2026). Lower some, or drag Sound, together.": "⚠ 声音部分合计 {#0}：凭耳朵听，合计 2.0 时低音变得沉重（05.10.2026）。调低一些，或整体拖动 声音。",
+"⚠ The music half carries {#0} together, past the shared ceiling {#1}: runs this heavy wrote broken scores every time (measured). Lower some, or take one off the music half.": "⚠ 音乐部分合计 {#0}，超过共同上限 {#1}：这么重的运行每次都写出坏掉的乐谱（已测量）。调低一些，或从音乐部分去掉一个。",
