+"Sound {#0}": "声音 {#0}",
+"Codes loaded: Generate renders that music again, in seconds.": "已加载代码：生成 会在几秒内重新渲染那段音乐。",
+"From “{0}”. Generate renders that same music ({1}) again; the VAE, the sound seed and the sound settings decide how it sounds. Versions and sliders do not apply.": "来自“{0}”。生成 会重新渲染同一段音乐（{1}）；VAE、声音种子和声音设置决定它的听感。版本和滑块不适用。",
+"Generate renders that same music ({0}) again; the VAE, the sound seed and the sound settings decide how it sounds. Versions and sliders do not apply.": "生成 会重新渲染同一段音乐（{0}）；VAE、声音种子和声音设置决定它的听感。版本和滑块不适用。",
+"Add-on slider (see Engine › Sliders) · {0}": "附加滑块（见 引擎 › 滑块）· {0}",
+"The words, with section tags such as [Verse], [Pre-Chorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro] on their own lines. The sections set the song's form, and together with the words its length: more sections, a longer song. Leave a blank line between sections. Lyrics count against the same budget as the style (see the counter under the style box).": "歌词，各段落标签如 [Verse]、[Pre-Chorus]、[Chorus]、[Bridge]、[Outro] 各占一行。段落决定歌曲的结构，与歌词一起决定长度：段落越多，歌越长。段落之间空一行。歌词与风格共用同一预算（见风格框下方的计数器）。",
+"Above 1.0 the words blur into glossolalia, most of all after the fourth minute (measured on a 7-minute song: 1.1 lost 16 of 109 lines). Below 0.8 the delivery flattens and starts to loop. 0 is greedy and loops.": "高于 1.0 时歌词会模糊成“说方言”般的含糊音，第四分钟后尤甚（在一首 7 分钟的歌上测量：1.1 丢了 109 行中的 16 行）。低于 0.8 时演唱变平并开始循环。0 是贪心解码，会循环。",
+"A community weight mix.": "社区的权重混合。",
+"The copy of the model the engine loads (from the next song).": "引擎加载的模型副本（从下一首歌开始）。",
+"BF16 · 7.2 GB · the full release": "BF16 · 7.2 GB · 完整版",
+"Q8_0 · 3.8 GB · near lossless": "Q8_0 · 3.8 GB · 近乎无损",
+"Q6_K · 2.9 GB, Q5_K_M · 2.6 GB · smaller, less VRAM": "Q6_K · 2.9 GB，Q5_K_M · 2.6 GB · 更小，显存更少",
+"Playing this version": "正在播放此版本",
+"Vocalise between sections": "段落间的元音吟唱",
+"What to paint, said in sentences: what is in the picture first, then the light, the colours and the medium (oils, ink, a photograph); end with no text when you want no letters in it. Ctrl+Enter draws": "用句子说出要画什么：先说画面里有什么，再说光线、色彩和媒介（油画、墨水、照片）；不想要文字时以 no text 结尾。Ctrl+Enter 开始绘制",
+"(Krea 2 Community License: its pictures pass a content filter); SDXL: CyberRealistic XL by Cyberdelia. Qwen-Image 2512 (Apache-2.0) paints a cover with Lightning (lightx2v, Apache-2.0) when its file is here; Qwen-Image 2.1 is under Qwen's research licence: research and evaluation only, not for a song that is sold. Times on an RTX 3090, the prompt and the look-over not counted.": "（Krea 2 Community License：其图片要经过内容过滤）；SDXL：Cyberdelia 的 CyberRealistic XL。Qwen-Image 2512（Apache-2.0）在文件就位时用 Lightning（lightx2v，Apache-2.0）画封面；Qwen-Image 2.1 采用 Qwen 的研究许可证：仅限研究和评估，不能用于出售的歌曲。时间在 RTX 3090 上测得，不含提示词和审看。",
+"Qwen-Image 2512 · Q4 · Lightning · about 15 GB · about 30 s a picture": "Qwen-Image 2512 · Q4 · Lightning · 约 15 GB · 每张约 30 秒",
+"Qwen-Image 2512 · {0} · Lightning · about 22 GB · about 40 s a picture": "Qwen-Image 2512 · {0} · Lightning · 约 22 GB · 每张约 40 秒",
+"Qwen-Image 2.1 · research licence · not for a song that is sold · about 21 GB · about 2 min a picture": "Qwen-Image 2.1 · 研究许可证 · 不能用于出售的歌曲 · 约 21 GB · 每张约 2 分钟",
+"UniverSR redraws the top of the spectrum after Debuzz and before the stems are split: the separators hear the whole song, and every stem keeps its share of the top (without stems, it goes before the remaster). Subtle above 12 kHz, normal above 8, high above 6; one variant, the original kept below the cutoff; about 1.6 times the length of the song on a 3090.": "UniverSR 在 Debuzz 之后、分轨之前重绘频谱高端：分离器听到整首歌，每条分轨都保有自己那份高频（没有分轨时，它在重制母带之前）。轻微：12 kHz 以上，正常：8 以上，高：6 以上；一个变体，截止频率以下保留原样；在 3090 上约为歌曲时长的 1.6 倍。",
+"The debuzzed (and upscaled) take split into stems: four (vocals, drums, bass and the rest, with the instrumental: BS-Roformer, then htdemucs_ft) or vocals (voice and instrumental). The remaster then mixes them: its preset balances them, and the de-esser works on the voice alone. They stay in the tree, for your DAW too.": "把去嗡声（并超分）后的录音分成分轨：四轨（人声、鼓、贝斯和其余部分，外加伴奏：先 BS-Roformer，再 htdemucs_ft）或人声（人声与伴奏）。然后重制母带把它们混合：预设负责平衡，去齿音只作用于人声。分轨保留在目录树中，也可用于你的 DAW。",
+"UniverSR once more, on the remaster: the stems leave a hiss above 20 kHz and the remaster keeps almost nothing above 22 (measured on a take), so the top is drawn anew, near the first upscale's. If the new top passes the remaster's true-peak ceiling, the whole file is turned down to it.": "在重制母带上再做一次 UniverSR：分轨在 20 kHz 以上留下嘶声，而重制母带几乎不保留 22 以上（在一段录音上测得），所以高端会重新绘制，接近第一次超分的结果。如果新的高端超过重制母带的真峰值上限，整个文件会被压低到该值。",
+"With the settings of the Remaster step below: from the stems when the chain splits them (the preset and the de-esser at work), else from the file before it": "使用下方“重制母带”步骤的设置：链路分轨时从分轨开始（预设和去齿音生效），否则从前一个文件开始",
+"How the stems are balanced in the mix, in dB a stem (the levels below win over it). Only for a set of stems: a single file, the take included, has nothing to balance, and the preset is off then; the chain uses it when it splits stems.": "分轨在混音中如何平衡，每条分轨以 dB 计（下方的电平优先）。仅用于一组分轨：单个文件（包括录音本身）没有可平衡的，此时预设关闭；链路分轨时会使用它。",
+"Softens the hiss of s, sh and ts on the voice stems before they are mixed. Only for a set of stems: on the take or a single file it is off; in the chain, when it splits stems, it works as set here.": "在混合前柔化人声分轨上 s、sh、ts 的嘶音。仅用于一组分轨：在录音或单个文件上关闭；在链路中分轨时按这里的设置工作。",
+"BS-Roformer ep317 (SDR 12.97) for the voice, then htdemucs_ft on the instrumental: vocals, drums, bass, other and the instrumental, about 6 minutes for 7 minutes of song on a 3090": "人声用 BS-Roformer ep317（SDR 12.97），再对伴奏用 htdemucs_ft：人声、鼓、贝斯、其他和伴奏，在 3090 上 7 分钟的歌约需 6 分钟",
+"The take with every stem split here, into your DAW: a REAPER project or a DAWproject": "带着在这里分出的每条分轨，把录音导入你的 DAW：REAPER 工程或 DAWproject",
+"What is split: the take, or a debuzzed or upscaled file of it (the chain splits the one before its remaster). Each source keeps its own set.": "要分轨的对象：录音，或它的去嗡声或超分后的文件（链路会分离重制母带之前的那个）。每个来源保留自己的一组。",
