+"How many steps the sound solver takes to turn the music tokens into audio (flow matching, midpoint method). 32 is the release setting; 160 is the ceiling.": "声音求解器把音乐令牌变成音频所走的步数（流匹配，midpoint 方法）。32 是发布时的设置；160 是上限。",
+"Each step runs the sound model twice over the whole song, so 64 steps make this stage take twice as long as 32; the music itself (melody, words, length) is already fixed by then and does not change.": "每一步都要让声音模型在整首歌上运行两次，所以 64 步时这一阶段耗时是 32 步的两倍；此时音乐本身（旋律、歌词、长度）已经确定，不会改变。",
+"Fewer steps (8–16) are quicker drafts. Whether 64 sounds better than 32 has not been published: to hear it, re-render one take's sound at both settings.": "更少的步数（8–16）能更快出草稿。64 是否比 32 好听尚无公开结论：想听出差别，就用两种设置分别重新渲染同一段录音的声音。",
+"Decode this take again with this VAE: its own sound, another decoder, in seconds": "用这个 VAE 重新解码这段录音：它自己的声音，换一个解码器，几秒完成",
+"Render this take's sound again with this VAE: it was made before takes kept their latents, so it takes as long as its sound did": "用这个 VAE 重新渲染这段录音的声音：它是在录音保存潜在表示之前做的，所以所需时间和当初的声音一样长",
