+"Wide-bore horn: dark, velvet, jazz ballads.": "宽管号：幽暗、天鹅绒般，爵士抒情曲。",
+"Tenor tuba: warm, singing, brass band.": "次中音大号：温暖、如歌，铜管乐队。",
+"A wooden horn metres long: soft natural-overtone calls across valleys.": "数米长的木号：越过山谷的柔和自然泛音呼喊。",
+"A seashell trumpet: one deep, ceremonial blast.": "海螺号：一声深沉的仪式性号鸣。",
+"Capped double reed: buzzing, nasal, quirky.": "带罩双簧乐器：嗡鸣、带鼻音、古怪。",
+"Medieval loud double reed: brash, outdoor, ancestor of the oboe.": "中世纪响亮双簧管：刺耳、户外，双簧管的祖先。",
+"Twin reed pipes: buzzing, piercing, drone and melody together.": "双管簧片笛：嗡鸣、穿透，持续音与旋律同时。",
+"Bamboo flute with a buzzing membrane: bright, reedy.": "带振动笛膜的竹笛：明亮、带簧片音。",
+"Chinese shawm: loud, brassy, celebration and funeral.": "唢呐：响亮、铜管般，喜事丧事都用。",
+"Mouth organ of pipes: chords that breathe in and out.": "管式口风琴（笙）：吸气呼气都能奏出的和弦。",
+"Gourd flute with drone pipes: soft, sweet, clarinet-like.": "带持续音管的葫芦丝：柔和甜美，似单簧管。",
+"Straight high sax: sweet, piercing, smooth jazz.": "直管高音萨克斯：甜美、穿透，柔顺爵士。",
+"Valveless signal horn: a few notes, calls and taps.": "无阀军号：几个音，号令与信号。",
+"Horn without valves: natural overtones, hunting calls.": "无阀圆号：自然泛音，狩猎号角。",
+"Kick, snare, toms, cymbals: a driving backbeat.": "底鼓、军鼓、通鼓、镲：有推动力的反拍。",
+"Wire brushes swept on a snare: soft swishes and taps.": "钢丝刷扫过军鼓：轻柔的沙沙声和轻敲。",
+"A synthetic bass drum: thumping four-on-the-floor.": "合成底鼓：四四拍的重拍。",
+"Drum with rattling wires: sharp cracks, marching rolls.": "带响弦的鼓：清脆的击打，进行曲滚奏。",
+"Metal plates: ticking hats, crashing and riding cymbals.": "金属片：滴答的踩镲、吊镲和叮叮镲。",
+"Tuned drums of the kit: rolling, tribal fills.": "架子鼓的调音通鼓：滚动的部落式加花。",
+"A wooden box you sit on and slap: bass thump and snappy edge.": "坐在上面拍打的木箱：低音的闷响和清脆的边缘音。",
+"Goblet hand drum: deep bass, sharp slaps.": "高脚杯手鼓：深沉的低音，清脆的拍击。",
+"Pair of hand drums: talking, bending, intricate strokes.": "一对手鼓：会说话般、音高弯曲、繁复的击打。",
+"Tall Cuban hand drums: open tones and slaps, Latin groove.": "高大的古巴手鼓：开放音和拍击，拉丁律动。",
+"Seeds in a vessel: a steady swishing pulse.": "容器里的种子：稳定的沙沙脉动。",
+"Tuned oil drums: bright, sunny, Caribbean.": "调音油桶鼓：明亮、阳光、加勒比风。",
+"Small paired drums: high, quick, chattering.": "成对的小鼓：高、快、喋喋不休。",
+"Clapping shells of wood: flamenco clicks and rolls.": "拍击的木制贝壳：弗拉门戈的咔嗒声和滚奏。",
+"A bent steel rod: a high, bright ting.": "弯曲的钢棒：高而亮的叮声。",
+"Metal bell without clapper: a dry, clanking accent.": "无舌金属铃：干脆的铛声重音。",
+"Hollow wooden block: dry, hollow clicks.": "空心木鱼：干而空的咔嗒声。",
+"Two hardwood sticks: a sharp, bright clave pattern.": "两根硬木棒：清脆明亮的克拉维节奏型。",
+"Irish frame drum with a stick: rolling, earthy pulse.": "用鼓棒敲的爱尔兰框鼓：滚动、质朴的脉动。",
+"Arab tambourine: crisp skin taps and jingle shimmer.": "阿拉伯铃鼓：清脆的鼓皮轻敲和响片的闪烁声。",
+"Large frame drum with rings: deep heartbeat and rattling shimmer.": "带环的大框鼓：深沉的心跳和哗啦的闪烁声。",
+"A sacred rattle of metal rods: dry, shimmering jingle.": "金属棒制成的神圣摇响器：干涩、闪烁的叮当声。",
+"A pair of large cymbals clashed: a huge, bright splash and a long shimmer.": "一对对击的大钹：巨大明亮的炸响和悠长的余晖。",
+"Big orchestral drum: deep thunder and rolls.": "大型乐队大鼓：深沉的雷声和滚奏。",
+"Steel bars with mallets: high, crystalline bells.": "用槌敲的钢片：高而晶莹的钟声。",
+"Metal bars with motor tremolo: cool, shimmering jazz.": "带电机颤音的金属片：冷峻闪烁的爵士。",
+"Wooden bars, hard mallets: bright, dry, quick.": "木片、硬槌：明亮、干脆、快速。",
+"Metal bowls struck or rubbed: long, pulsing, meditative tones.": "敲击或摩擦的金属钵：悠长、脉动、冥想的音。",
+"A tube of pebbles turned over: the sound of falling rain.": "翻转的卵石管：落雨的声音。",
+"A clay pot drum: deep, watery, bubbling bass.": "陶罐鼓：深沉、似水、咕嘟作响的低音。",
+"Hourglass drum squeezed under the arm: pitch bends like speech.": "夹在腋下挤压的沙漏鼓：音高像说话一样弯曲。",
+"Great bells in a tower: tolling, overtone-rich peals.": "塔楼里的大钟：泛音丰富的鸣钟声。",
+"Clapping hands: a dry rhythmic pulse.": "拍手：干脆的节奏脉动。",
+"The sambuca as Viktor's styles name it: plucked strings of a hollow body, melodic breath, rhythmic interplay.": "Viktor 的风格中所称的萨姆布卡：空心琴身的拨弦、旋律的气息、节奏的互动。",
+"The sambuca by what it was: a small triangular harp of few strings, high and bright (the sabbeka of Daniel 3).": "本来意义上的萨姆布卡：弦少的小三角竖琴，高而亮（但以理书 3 章的 sabbeka）。",
+"Quartz bowls rubbed with a mallet: pure, almost sine tones that do not end.": "用槌摩擦的水晶钵：纯净、几近正弦、不会结束的音。",
+"A whole orchestral string section: lush, wide violins over violas, cellos and basses.": "整组管弦乐弦乐：中提琴、大提琴和低音提琴之上丰满宽广的小提琴。",
+"Birds singing in a garden or a forest at dawn: a sound of nature, not an instrument.": "黎明时花园或森林里的鸟鸣：自然的声音，不是乐器。",
+"Cicadas in summer heat: a dry, shimmering, endless buzz.": "盛夏酷热中的蝉鸣：干涩、闪烁、无尽的嗡鸣。",
+"A rushing river and a waterfall: white noise of water, near and far.": "奔流的河与瀑布：远近的水的白噪声。",
+"The Yakut jaw harp: a metal tongue twanged at the mouth, a buzzing drone whose overtones the breath shapes; the shaman's sound.": "雅库特口簧琴：在嘴边弹拨的金属簧片，嗡鸣的持续音，泛音由气息塑造；萨满的声音。",
+"A large oval frame drum struck with a beater, iron pendants jingling: the trance heartbeat of a Siberian shaman.": "用槌敲击的大型椭圆框鼓，铁坠叮当作响：西伯利亚萨满的出神心跳。",
+"Mongolia's two-string horsehead fiddle: a deep, resonant, galloping bowed voice of the steppe.": "蒙古两弦马头琴：草原上深沉、共鸣、奔腾的弓弦之声。",
+"The Tuvan two-string fiddle: husky and droning, kin to throat singing.": "图瓦两弦提琴：沙哑、持续音，与呼麦同源。",
+"The shofar asked by its calls: tekiah, shevarim, teruah, tekiah gedolah.": "按号音要求的羊角号：tekiah、shevarim、teruah、tekiah gedolah。",
+"The shofar asked as a raw two-note horn a fifth apart.": "要求为相隔纯五度的粗粝两音号的羊角号。",
+"A valveless horn as a war signal: the shofar's role, another instrument's name.": "作为战争信号的无阀号：羊角号的角色，用另一种乐器的名字。",
+"Conch calls: deep ceremonial blasts, a cousin of the shofar's sound.": "海螺号声：深沉的仪式性号鸣，羊角号之声的近亲。",
+"Bugle calls, raw and out of tune: the shofar's gesture on brass.": "粗粝走音的军号声：用铜管做出羊角号的姿态。",
+"An animal horn, ram or kudu: buzzing ritual blasts.": "动物角号，公羊角或捻角羚角：嗡鸣的仪式号声。",
+"The shofar asked by its feast: Rosh Hashanah, tekiah, shevarim, teruah.": "按节期要求的羊角号：犹太新年，tekiah、shevarim、teruah。",
+"Concert grand with its lid closed: soft, warm, intimate, slightly veiled.": "合上琴盖的音乐会三角钢琴：柔和、温暖、亲密，略带朦胧。",
+"Grand piano with its lid on the short stick: rounded and balanced.": "琴盖支在短支杆上的三角钢琴：圆润而平衡。",
+"Concert grand with its lid fully open: bright, ringing, resonant, with a long sustain.": "琴盖全开的音乐会三角钢琴：明亮、响亮、共鸣，延音悠长。",
+"Helmet-shaped gusli, a large plucked board zither: harp-like arpeggios ringing into each other.": "盔形古斯里，大型拨弦板齐特琴：竖琴般互相交融的琶音。",
+"Table gusli, a concert board zither for both hands: melody, arpeggios and glissandi on many metal strings.": "台式古斯里，双手演奏的音乐会板齐特琴：在许多金属弦上奏出旋律、琶音和滑奏。",
+"Finnish plucked board zither: bright metal strings, gentle arpeggios over open-string drones.": "芬兰拨弦板齐特琴：明亮的金属弦，在空弦持续音上的柔和琶音。",
+"The kinnor, King David's lyre: gut strings plucked by hand, slow hypnotic arpeggios, a psalm-like modal melody.": "金诺尔，大卫王的里拉琴：用手拨的羊肠弦，缓慢催眠的琶音，诗篇般的调式旋律。",
+"The nevel, the ancient Hebrew harp: larger and deeper, warm low gut strings, a solemn melody of the Temple.": "内维尔，古希伯来竖琴：更大更低沉，温暖的低音羊肠弦，圣殿庄严的旋律。",
+"The kithara, ancient Greece's concert lyre with a wooden sound box: plucked with a plectrum, bright and resonant.": "基萨拉，古希腊带木质共鸣箱的音乐会里拉琴：用拨子弹奏，明亮而共鸣。",
+"The Sumerian lyre of Ur: a few gut strings plucked by hand, a dry woody tone, an archaic melody over a drone.": "乌尔的苏美尔里拉琴：几根用手拨的羊肠弦，干涩的木质音色，持续音上的古老旋律。",
+"Medieval psaltery plucked with quills: delicate, bright, tinkling arpeggios.": "用羽管拨奏的中世纪诗琴：精致、明亮、叮当的琶音。",
+"Bowed psaltery, a triangular zither played with a bow: sustained, glassy, ethereal notes that swell and fade.": "弓奏诗琴，用弓拉的三角齐特琴：持续、玻璃般、空灵的音，渐强又渐弱。",
+"Alpine concert zither: a melody fretted and plucked with a thumb ring over open-string accompaniment, Viennese.": "阿尔卑斯音乐会齐特琴：按品并用拇指拨片弹出的旋律，配空弦伴奏，维也纳风。",
+"Hungarian concert cimbalom, a large hammered dulcimer with soft mallets: shimmering tremolos, fast runs, rolled chords.": "匈牙利音乐会钦巴龙，用软槌的大型扬琴：闪烁的颤音、快速跑动、分解和弦。",
+"Russian gudok, an archaic three-stringed fiddle held on the knee: a raw nasal melody over a droning string.": "俄罗斯古多克，放在膝上的古老三弦提琴：持续音弦之上粗粝带鼻音的旋律。",
+"A dark slow melody that swells from a whisper to a storm and falls back into silence.": "一段幽暗缓慢的旋律，从低语涨成风暴，又落回寂静。",
+"A slow trance pulse, a ritual heartbeat, a melody that grows into a storm.": "缓慢的出神脉动，仪式的心跳，一段渐长成风暴的旋律。",
+"Unhurried and spacious: long held notes, silence between the phrases.": "从容而开阔：长时值的音，乐句之间的静默。",
+"Sensual, grand and dramatic: a romantic melody over a warm pulse, Eastern colours.": "感性、宏大而富戏剧性：温暖脉动上的浪漫旋律，东方色彩。",
+"From an intimate opening to a monumental bloom.": "从亲密的开场到宏伟的绽放。",
+"Raw passion and ritual fire in ancient Eastern modes, a slow ecstatic build.": "古老东方调式中的原始激情与仪式之火，缓慢的狂喜渐强。",
+"Luminous, crystalline, intimate: a slow sensual melody that never hurries.": "明亮、晶莹、亲密：一段从不匆忙的缓慢感性旋律。",
+"Wooden textures and string vibrations, single notes and long pauses.": "木质的质感与弦的振动，单音和长长的停顿。",
+"Ancient crystalline stillness, luminous swells, a slow heartbeat.": "古老晶莹的静谧，明亮的涌动，缓慢的心跳。",
+"Darkness rising into radiant light: a slow modulation from tension to warmth.": "黑暗升向灿烂的光：从紧张到温暖的缓慢转调。",
+"A gentle three-four sway, a nostalgic melody, an old dance hall.": "轻柔的三拍摇摆，怀旧的旋律，一座老舞厅。",
+"A slow melancholy tune, a village evening, an old song.": "缓慢忧郁的曲调，村庄的傍晚，一首老歌。",
+"Heavy guitars, dark melodic riffs, a grand and mournful atmosphere.": "沉重的吉他，幽暗的旋律性连复段，宏大而哀伤的氛围。",
+"Driving guitars, a heavy groove, raw powerful energy.": "有推动力的吉他，沉重的律动，原始而强大的能量。",
+"A full orchestra: strings, brass and timpani in a slow grand theme.": "完整的管弦乐队：弦乐、铜管和定音鼓奏出缓慢宏大的主题。",
+"A slow build to a monumental climax, long cinematic pauses.": "缓慢推向宏伟高潮，电影般的长停顿。",
+"A relentless war drive at marching tempo, thundering percussion, urgent momentum.": "进行曲速度下不屈不挠的战争推进，雷鸣般的打击乐，紧迫的势头。",
+"Ethereal mysticism on a slow heartbeat: waves that swell and recede, a long fading resonance (Мавка).": "缓慢心跳上的空灵神秘：涨落的波浪，悠长渐逝的共鸣（Мавка）。",
+"A variable heartbeat tempo, primordial darkness, an ancestral weight.": "变化的心跳速度，原初的黑暗，祖先的重量。",
+"The Earth's moan: a variable shamanic heartbeat, relaxed unpredictable meditations.": "大地的呻吟：变化的萨满心跳，放松而难以预料的冥想。",
+"Bright, settled, consonant.": "明亮、安定、协和。",
+"Sad, plain, open.": "悲伤、朴素、开放。",
+"The raised seventh pulls hard to the tonic: dramatic, exotic.": "升高的第七级强烈地倾向主音：富戏剧性、异域感。",
+"Minor with a bright raised sixth and seventh, rising.": "带明亮升高的第六、第七级的小调，上行。",
+"Minor with a bright sixth: tender, hopeful.": "带明亮第六级的小调：温柔、充满希望。",
+"Minor with a dark lowered second: ancient, severe.": "带幽暗降低第二级的小调：古老、严峻。",
+"The lowered second and the major third: Eastern, a warrior's mode.": "降低的第二级加大三度：东方的、武士的调式。",
+"Major with a raised fourth: floating, pure light.": "带增四度的大调：漂浮、纯净的光。",
+"The raised fourth and the lowered sixth: soaring with a shadow.": "增四度加降低的第六级：带着阴影的飞升。",
+"Major with a lowered seventh: earthy, meditative.": "带降低第七级的大调：质朴、冥想。",
+"The diminished fifth: unstable, dark, unresolved.": "减五度：不稳定、幽暗、不解决。",
+"Two augmented seconds: ritual fire, the East.": "两个增二度：仪式之火，东方。",
+"Major with a lowered sixth: a haunting bright breath.": "带降低第六级的大调：萦绕心头的明亮气息。",
+"orchestr* is an orchestral arrangement: whatever instrument the word stands before, YuE2 builds a whole orchestra around it and loses the instrument (asked for orchestral crash cymbals, it played the orchestra). His probes probe60-orchestral, made again at full length on their seeds.": "orchestr* 是管弦乐编配：无论这个词放在哪种乐器前，YuE2 都会围绕它搭起整支乐队，而把那件乐器弄丢（要求管弦乐吊镲时，它演奏了整个乐队）。他的样例 probe60-orchestral，用各自的种子以完整长度重新制作。",
+"Asked for cicadas, YuE2 plays a whole summer ambient: the dry shimmering buzz over soft music.": "要求蝉鸣时，YuE2 会奏出整段夏日氛围：柔和音乐之上干涩闪烁的嗡鸣。",
+"A slow meditation on the pumped reed organ: warm, wheezing, devotional. His harmonium probes went among the styles; made again as one, two minutes on their seeds (04.10.2026).": "脚踏簧风琴上的缓慢冥想：温暖、喘息般、虔诚。他的簧风琴样例归入了风格；用各自的种子合并重做为一个，两分钟（04.10.2026）。",
+"His mode for «Manifest: the Cry»: the lowered second and the diminished fifth together, dark anger.": "他为《宣言：呐喊》所用的调式：降低的第二级与减五度同时出现，幽暗的愤怒。",
+"His mode for «Manifest: I Have Returned»: the minor's bright sixth and the relative major's raised fourth, tenderness in a high register.": "他为《宣言：我回来了》所用的调式：小调明亮的第六级加关系大调的增四度，高音区的温柔。",
+"His mode for «Heavens»: from the earthy major with a lowered seventh into the harmonic minor, a warm resolution.": "他为《诸天》所用的调式：从带降低第七级的质朴大调进入和声小调，温暖的解决。",
+"His mode for «The Final Manifest»: from the harmonic minor's pull into the Lydian's pure light, darkness to light.": "他为《最后的宣言》所用的调式：从和声小调的引力进入利底亚纯净的光，从黑暗到光明。",
+"The old line for «Oasis of Love» in his mode table (the track's own block has double harmonic): Dorian's bright sixth with the Aeolian major's lowered one.": "他调式表中《爱的绿洲》的旧条目（该曲自己的区块写的是双和声）：多利亚明亮的第六级加伊奥利亚大调降低的第六级。",
+"A dark slow melody that swells from a whisper to a storm and falls back into silence. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a female contralto, solo, close-miked and in front.": "一段幽暗缓慢的旋律，从低语涨成风暴，又落回寂静。由女低音以俄语独唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，近距离拾音，置于前方。",
+"A slow trance pulse, a ritual heartbeat, a melody that grows into a storm. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a female contralto, solo, close-miked and in front.": "缓慢的出神脉动，仪式的心跳，一段渐长成风暴的旋律。由女低音以俄语独唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，近距离拾音，置于前方。",
+"From an intimate opening to a monumental bloom. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a male baritone, warm, solo and in front.": "从亲密的开场到宏伟的绽放。由男中音以俄语温暖地独唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，置于前方。",
+"A gentle three-four sway, a nostalgic melody, an old dance hall. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a female mezzo-soprano, warm, solo and in front.": "轻柔的三拍摇摆，怀旧的旋律，一座老舞厅。由女中音以俄语温暖地独唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，置于前方。",
+"A slow melancholy tune, a village evening, an old song. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a male baritone, solo and in front.": "缓慢忧郁的曲调，村庄的傍晚，一首老歌。由男中音以俄语独唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，置于前方。",
+"Heavy guitars, dark melodic riffs, a grand and mournful atmosphere. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a female contralto, powerful dark gothic metal singing.": "沉重的吉他，幽暗的旋律性连复段，宏大而哀伤的氛围。由女低音以俄语用有力幽暗的哥特金属唱法演唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词。",
+"Driving guitars, a heavy groove, raw powerful energy. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a male baritone, raspy powerful rock singing.": "有推动力的吉他，沉重的律动，原始而强大的能量。由男中音以俄语用沙哑有力的摇滚唱法演唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词。",
+"A full orchestra: strings, brass and timpani in a slow grand theme. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a mixed choir, four parts, over the orchestra.": "完整的管弦乐队：弦乐、铜管和定音鼓奏出缓慢宏大的主题。由混声合唱团以俄语四声部在乐队之上演唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词。",
+"A slow build to a monumental climax, long cinematic pauses. Sung in Russian to the words of «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song) by a male choir in unison and harmony, deep basses.": "缓慢推向宏伟高潮，电影般的长停顿。由男声合唱团以俄语齐唱并合唱《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）的歌词，低音深沉。",
+"A relentless war drive at marching tempo, thundering percussion, urgent momentum. Sung in Ukrainian to the words of «Oi na hori dva dubky» (a Ukrainian folk song) by a duet of choirs: a male choir in unison sings the Cossack's lines, a female choir answers as the girl, both sing the chorus, a marching war song.": "进行曲速度下不屈不挠的战争推进，雷鸣般的打击乐，紧迫的势头。由两个合唱团以乌克兰语对唱《Oi na hori dva dubky》（乌克兰民歌）的歌词：男声合唱团齐唱哥萨克的句子，女声合唱团以姑娘的身份应答，副歌合唱，一首行进的战歌。",
+"Ethereal mysticism on a slow heartbeat: waves that swell and recede, a long fading resonance. Sung in Ukrainian to the words of «Oi na hori dva dubky» (a Ukrainian folk song) by a duet: a male baritone sings the Cossack's lines, a female contralto answers as the girl, both sing the chorus, a low ritual chant.": "缓慢心跳上的空灵神秘：涨落的波浪，悠长渐逝的共鸣。以乌克兰语对唱《Oi na hori dva dubky》（乌克兰民歌）的歌词：男中音唱哥萨克的句子，女低音以姑娘的身份应答，副歌合唱，一段低沉的仪式吟诵。",
+"A variable heartbeat tempo, primordial darkness, an ancestral weight. Sung in Ukrainian to the words of «Oi na hori dva dubky» (a Ukrainian folk song) by a duet: a male baritone sings the Cossack's lines, a female contralto answers as the girl, both sing the chorus, chanting.": "变化的心跳速度，原初的黑暗，祖先的重量。以乌克兰语对唱《Oi na hori dva dubky》（乌克兰民歌）的歌词：男中音唱哥萨克的句子，女低音以姑娘的身份应答，副歌合唱，吟诵式。",
+"The Earth's moan: a variable shamanic heartbeat, relaxed unpredictable meditations. Sung in Ukrainian to the words of «Oi na hori dva dubky» (a Ukrainian folk song) by a duet: a male bass sings the Cossack's lines, a female mezzo-soprano answers as the girl, both sing the chorus.": "大地的呻吟：变化的萨满心跳，放松而难以预料的冥想。以乌克兰语对唱《Oi na hori dva dubky》（乌克兰民歌）的歌词：男低音唱哥萨克的句子，女中音以姑娘的身份应答，副歌合唱。",
+"Sensual, grand and dramatic: a romantic melody over a warm pulse, Eastern colours. Sung in Greek to the words of «Milo mou kokkino» (a Macedonian Greek folk song) by a female mezzo-soprano, solo and in front.": "感性、宏大而富戏剧性：温暖脉动上的浪漫旋律，东方色彩。由女中音以希腊语独唱《Milo mou kokkino》（马其顿希腊民歌）的歌词，置于前方。",
+"Raw passion and ritual fire in ancient Eastern modes, a slow ecstatic build. Sung in Greek to the words of «Milo mou kokkino» (a Macedonian Greek folk song) by a female contralto, solo and in front.": "古老东方调式中的原始激情与仪式之火，缓慢的狂喜渐强。由女低音以希腊语独唱《Milo mou kokkino》（马其顿希腊民歌）的歌词，置于前方。",
+"Luminous, crystalline, intimate: a slow sensual melody that never hurries. Sung in Greek to the words of «Milo mou kokkino» (a Macedonian Greek folk song) by a female mezzo-soprano, soft and intimate.": "明亮、晶莹、亲密：一段从不匆忙的缓慢感性旋律。由女中音以希腊语柔和亲密地演唱《Milo mou kokkino》（马其顿希腊民歌）的歌词。",
+"Unhurried and spacious: long held notes, silence between the phrases. Sung in Hebrew to the words of «Hava Nagila» by a male bass-baritone, a slow chant.": "从容而开阔：长时值的音，乐句之间的静默。由男低中音以希伯来语缓慢吟唱《Hava Nagila》的歌词。",
+"Wooden textures and string vibrations, single notes and long pauses. Sung in Hebrew to the words of «Hava Nagila» by a male tenor, soft, solo and in front.": "木质的质感与弦的振动，单音和长长的停顿。由男高音以希伯来语柔和地独唱《Hava Nagila》的歌词，置于前方。",
+"Ancient crystalline stillness, luminous swells, a slow heartbeat. Sung in Hebrew to the words of «Hava Nagila» by a female choir in close harmony.": "古老晶莹的静谧，明亮的涌动，缓慢的心跳。由女声合唱团以希伯来语用密集和声演唱《Hava Nagila》的歌词。",
+"Darkness rising into radiant light: a slow modulation from tension to warmth. Sung in Hebrew to the words of «Hava Nagila» by a mixed choir, four parts.": "黑暗升向灿烂的光：从紧张到温暖的缓慢转调。由混声合唱团以希伯来语四声部演唱《Hava Nagila》的歌词。",
+"Pop, sung in English to the words of «Scarborough Fair» (a traditional English ballad).": "流行，以英语演唱《Scarborough Fair》（英格兰传统叙事曲）的歌词。",
+"Hip-hop and rap, rapped in English to the words of «The Raven» (Poe, 1845); made again so that it raps: the Suno list's own words gave singing (Viktor's ear and Whisper, 05.10.2026).": "嘻哈与说唱，以英语说唱《The Raven》（爱伦·坡，1845）的歌词；为了让它说唱而重新制作：用 Suno 列表原本的词得到的是演唱（Viktor 的耳朵和 Whisper，05.10.2026）。",
+"R&B and soul, sung in English to the words of «Scarborough Fair» (a traditional English ballad).": "R&B 与灵魂乐，以英语演唱《Scarborough Fair》（英格兰传统叙事曲）的歌词。",
