+"The nineteenth-century romance, with its seven-string guitar. Sung to «Ochi chornye» (Grebenka, 1843).": "十九世纪的浪漫曲，配七弦吉他。用《黑眼睛》（格列边卡，1843）演唱。",
+"A slow start that breaks into a wild dance. Sung to «Ochi chornye» (Grebenka, 1843).": "缓慢开始，迸发成狂野的舞蹈。用《黑眼睛》（格列边卡，1843）演唱。",
+"A Cossack song: the lone voice and the choir answering. Sung to «Oi, to ne vecher» (a Cossack folk song).": "一首哥萨克歌：孤独的嗓音与应答的合唱。用《Oi, to ne vecher》（哥萨克民歌）演唱。",
+"Plainchant: one line, many voices, a stone vault. Sung to the Pater noster and the Kyrie (Latin).": "素歌：一条旋律线，众多声音，石砌拱顶。用《天主经》（Pater noster）和《垂怜经》（拉丁语）演唱。",
+"The chanters' melisma over the held ison. Sung to the Trisagion and the Kyrie (Greek).": "领唱者在持续的 ison 上的花腔。用《三圣颂》和《垂怜经》（希腊语）演唱。",
+"The old Russian unison chant. Sung to the Trisagion and «Lord, have mercy» (Church Slavonic).": "古老的俄罗斯齐唱圣咏。用《三圣颂》和“主啊，求你怜悯”（教会斯拉夫语）演唱。",
+"The Orthodox choir a cappella, its basses an octave down. Sung to the Trisagion and «Lord, have mercy» (Church Slavonic).": "无伴奏的东正教合唱，低音低八度。用《三圣颂》和“主啊，求你怜悯”（教会斯拉夫语）演唱。",
+"A wordless melody of the Hasidim, climbing into joy. Sung to a wordless nigun (vocables).": "哈西德派的无词旋律，攀升至喜乐。用无词的尼贡（衬词）演唱。",
+"The cantor's florid prayer. Sung to Psalm 133:1, «Hine ma tov» (Hebrew).": "领唱者华丽的祈祷。用诗篇 133:1“Hine ma tov”（希伯来语）演唱。",
+"Call and response, a cappella. Sung to «Swing Low, Sweet Chariot» (a spiritual).": "呼应式，无伴奏。用《Swing Low, Sweet Chariot》（灵歌）演唱。",
+"A hymn with the organ and the whole church singing. Sung to «Amazing Grace» (Newton, 1779).": "管风琴伴奏、全会众同唱的赞美诗。用《Amazing Grace》（牛顿，1779）演唱。",
+"A short phrase sung again and again, as prayer. Sung to «Ubi caritas» (Latin).": "一句短短的乐句反复吟唱，如同祷告。用《Ubi caritas》（拉丁语）演唱。",
+"The Requiem's own words, choir and strings. Sung to the Requiem's own words (Latin).": "安魂曲本身的经文，合唱与弦乐。用安魂曲本身的经文（拉丁语）演唱。",
+"A plain hymn of the Shakers, luminous. Sung to «Simple Gifts» (Brackett, 1848).": "震颤派朴素明亮的赞美诗。用《Simple Gifts》（布拉克特，1848）演唱。",
+"Counterpoint over the harpsichord's continuo.": "羽管键琴通奏低音之上的对位。",
