+"A reading needs a real reader's voice adapter (a LoRA of a reader): without one YuE2 lays any voice onto music, one way or another, and a clean reading over a musical accompaniment is what is wanted. All of it is subject to close prompt tuning, seed excavation & listener's evaluation.": "朗读需要真实朗读者的嗓音适配器（朗读者的 LoRA）：没有它，YuE2 总会以某种方式把某个嗓音放到音乐上，而我们想要的是在音乐伴奏上干净的朗读。这一切都取决于细致的提示调整、种子挖掘和听者的评判。",
