+"Photos, also JPEG-compressed or a little blurred: detailed and natural. The studio's default; slow.": "照片，也包括有 JPEG 压缩或稍有模糊的：细致而自然。工作室的默认；较慢。",
+"Clean photos (not compressed, not blurred): the most faithful detail on good input. Slow.": "干净的照片（无压缩、无模糊）：在好的输入上细节最忠实。较慢。",
+"Photos taken from the web: JPEG or WebP compression, blur and noise mended as it upscales. Slow.": "来自网络的照片：超分时修复 JPEG 或 WebP 压缩、模糊和噪点。较慢。",
+"Photos with JPEG compression; keeps the grain and the noise. The slowest here, and in full precision only.": "有 JPEG 压缩的照片；保留颗粒和噪点。这里最慢，且只能用全精度。",
+"Degraded photos, faces too: a large model trained on blur, noise and compression. Slow, and the heaviest on the card.": "受损的照片，包括面部：用模糊、噪点和压缩训练的大模型。较慢，对显卡负担最重。",
+"Photos with JPEG compression and blur: a large model for realistic detail. Slow and heavy.": "有 JPEG 压缩和模糊的照片：追求写实细节的大模型。较慢且沉重。",
+"Photos, quick: mends little, keeps the most of the picture's own texture.": "照片，快速：修复很少，最大限度保留图片本身的质感。",
+"Photos, quick: mends blur, noise and compression in the middle measure.": "照片，快速：适度修复模糊、噪点和压缩。",
+"Photos, quick: mends strongly (smoother). The first pass of Viktor's ComfyUI chain.": "照片，快速：强力修复（更平滑）。Viktor 的 ComfyUI 链的第一遍。",
+"Realistic pictures, best on faces, hair and nature; a soft, natural look with few artifacts, for fairly clean input (not grainy). Quick. Non-commercial.": "写实图片，最适合面部、头发和自然；柔和自然、伪影少，适用于比较干净的输入（不粗糙）。快速。非商用。",
+"ClearReality's softer sister: kinder to rendered and game pictures, weaker on real photos. Quick. Non-commercial.": "ClearReality 更柔和的姐妹：对渲染图和游戏图更友好，对真实照片较弱。快速。非商用。",
+"Realistic photos with noise and compression. Quick.": "带噪点和压缩的写实照片。快速。",
+"An all-rounder for clean or lightly compressed pictures (JPEG quality 75 and up). Quick.": "适用于干净或轻度压缩图片（JPEG 质量 75 及以上）的全能型。快速。",
+"NMKD Siax again, as safetensors: the same model as 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k. Quick.": "又一个 NMKD Siax，safetensors 格式：与 4x_NMKD-Siax_200k 是同一个模型。快速。",
+"General pictures with more detail and less smoothing: skin and fine texture do not turn mushy. Quick. Non-commercial. The third pass of Viktor's chain.": "通用图片，细节更多、平滑更少：皮肤和细微质感不会糊成一片。快速。非商用。Viktor 链的第三遍。",
+"Remacri, smoother: fewer edges and less grain. Quick. Non-commercial.": "更平滑的 Remacri：边缘更少，颗粒更少。快速。非商用。",
+"Natural pictures with sharpness and detail in balance. Quick. Non-commercial. The last pass of Viktor's chain.": "锐度与细节平衡的自然图片。快速。非商用。Viktor 链的最后一遍。",
+"UltraMix leaning to repair: damaged and compressed input. Quick. Non-commercial.": "偏向修复的 UltraMix：受损和压缩的输入。快速。非商用。",
+"UltraMix, smoother: soft surfaces, little sharpening. Quick. Non-commercial.": "更平滑的 UltraMix：柔和的表面，锐化很少。快速。非商用。",
+"Almost anything: photos, anime, cartoons, illustration, artwork and text; sharp. Slow. Non-commercial.": "几乎什么都行：照片、动漫、卡通、插画、艺术作品和文字；锐利。较慢。非商用。",
+"UltraSharp V2 again: the same file as 4x_UltraSharp_v2. Slow. Non-commercial.": "又一个 UltraSharp V2：与 4x_UltraSharp_v2 是同一个文件。较慢。非商用。",
+"Realistic pictures, neither soft nor sharp. Quick.": "写实图片，不软不锐。快速。",
+"Realistic pictures, sharper. Quick.": "写实图片，更锐利。快速。",
+"Realistic pictures, the sharpest of the three. Quick.": "写实图片，三者中最锐利。快速。",
+"Small realistic textures crushed by JPEG or BC1, and outdoor photos. Quick.": "被 JPEG 或 BC1 压坏的小型写实纹理，以及户外照片。快速。",
+"The classic for real-world photos: compression, noise and blur mended. Quick; a free licence.": "真实世界照片的经典之选：修复压缩、噪点和模糊。快速；自由许可证。",
+"Real-ESRGAN at 2×. Quick; a free licence.": "2× 的 Real-ESRGAN。快速；自由许可证。",
+"A tiny model for everyday pictures: the quickest here. A free licence.": "用于日常图片的极小模型：这里最快。自由许可证。",
+"The tiny general model with denoising. The quickest here. A free licence.": "带降噪的极小通用模型。这里最快。自由许可证。",
+"A research model trained on clean pictures: for clean input only. Small, yet slow. A free licence.": "用干净图片训练的研究模型：只适用于干净的输入。体积小，却很慢。自由许可证。",
+"Faces in good-quality photos. Slow.": "高质量照片中的面部。较慢。",
+"Faces in good-quality photos, sharper. Slow.": "高质量照片中的面部，更锐利。较慢。",
+"Faces at 8×. Heavy on the card (8 GB).": "8× 的面部。对显卡负担重（8 GB）。",
+"Not an upscaler: the same size, more contrast in skin (backgrounds change a little). A pass of its own in a chain.": "不是超分器：尺寸不变，皮肤对比度更高（背景会稍有变化）。在链中作为单独一遍。",
+"2D art and anime, JPEG and dithering mended. Quick.": "2D 艺术和动漫，修复 JPEG 和抖动。快速。",
+"Anime and cartoons. Quick.": "动漫和卡通。快速。",
+"Anime pictures, a small model. Quick; a free licence.": "动漫图片，小模型。快速；自由许可证。",
+"Realistic pictures at 8×. Heavy on the card (8 GB).": "8× 的写实图片。对显卡负担重（8 GB）。",
