+"Remove a section: take one or more sections out of this take's own sound, each cut on its score's bar lines and healed by a short crossfade, the score cut along. A new take; this one stays.": "删除段落：从这段录音自身的声音中去掉一个或多个段落，每处沿乐谱的小节线切开并用短交叉淡化接合，乐谱一并裁剪。生成新的录音；这个保留。",
+"Speed: this take faster or slower, its pitch kept (Rubber Band), its score's tempo written anew. A new take; this one stays.": "速度：让这段录音更快或更慢，保持音高（Rubber Band），重写乐谱的速度。生成新的录音；这个保留。",
